<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">2 Khang tangthu</book>
  <para style="h">2 Khang tangthu</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Khang tangthu</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Khang tangthu</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Khang tangthu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David kumpipa ii tapa Solomon in Israel kumpi ngam a kho takin uk a, Topa a Pathian in ama thupha pia in a vaang liansak mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in a ngalkap tulkhat a uk le zakhat a uk ngalkapmangte theampo, kumpi naseam ulian theampo, innkuan lutangte theampo le a taanglai mite tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gibeon khua biakna munah ama taw a pai khop natu thupia hi. Amate tua munah a pai uh hi, banghang ziam cile tua mun sia Topa naseampa Moses ii duisung ngampa ah a vawt Topa ompuina Puanbuk omna mun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />(Thuciamna Thingkuang sia ahile David kumpipa ii Kiriath Jearim pan a laak lai in, Jerusalem khua ah a sak puanbuk khat sungah kikeam hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hur ii tupa, Uri ii tapa Bezalel ii taau taw a vawt biaknatau sia zongh Gibeon khua Topa ompuina Puanbuk mai ah om hi. Tua munah Solomon kumpipa le mipite theampo in Topa bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puanbuk mai ah tua biaknatau tungah kumpipa in sangaw biakpiaknate taw Topa bia a; nganno tulkhat ngosakin tuasia tungah a pum bup in haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zanin Solomon kungah Pathian kilangh a, “Bang hong pia leng na uuk ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Solomon in, “Ka pa David tungah itna lian na lak tawntung a, tuaciang tu in a kumpi za nong laihsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa Pathian awng, ka pa tungah na kamciamte taangtungsak in. A kisim zo ngawl za dongin a tam mama mite tungah kumpi nong suaksak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua ahikom amate ka uk natu in ka taangsap ciimna le heakna hong pia ta'n. Tua hi buathong le, hi za a tam na mipite koibang uk zo tu khi ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Solomon tungah, “A maan sia na teal zo hi. Ka mite uk tu in nangma kumpi in kong teal zo a, tua ka mite na uk thei natu in nei le lamh, sum le vanh manpha, minthanna, na ngalte thi natu, nangma khansau natu nong nget taangin ciimna le heakna nong ngen zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in ciimna le heakna nang kong pia tu hi. Tua bek dom ngawlin kumpi khat pawpo zongh ii a nei ngeingawl ahibuale a nei kik ngeingawl tu nei le lamh, sum le vanh manpha, le minthanna a tamzaw kong pia tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Solomon in Topa ompuina Puanbuk omna ahi Gibeon khua biakna mun nusia in Jerusalem ah heak kik hi. Tua mun panin ama in Israel ngam uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in ngalsim natu in siphu ngalleang 1,400, siphu ngalkap 12,000 khawmtua hi. Tuate pawlkhat sia Jerusalem ah keam in, pawlkhat sia khuapi dang tuatuamte ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama kumpi maan sungin Jerusalem ah ngunn le khamh sia suang bangma in tam a, Judah ngam ah cedar thingkung sia sycomore thingkung thawthong za in tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa atu taangmite in Musri le Cilicia pan ngamdang a puak siphu le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt pan ngamdang ah siphu ngalleangte puakna vai zeak uh hi. Amate in Hit te le Syria kumpite tungah siphute le siphu ngalleangte zuakin, siphu ngalleang khat ciang ngunn dangkatang 600 le siphu khat ciang ngunn dangkatang 150 taw veu in zuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in Topa biak natu biakinn khat le ama ii teen natu kumpi inn khat sak tu in khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in vanhte a puak tu in mihing 70,000 le mualtung ngam ah suangkhuk to tu in mihing 80,000 koi hi. Nasepna a uk tu in mihing 3,600 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in Tyre kumpipa Hiram tungah a vaithakna panin: “A kumpi inn sak natu in ka pa David kumpipa tungah cedar thingluangte na zuak bangma in kei taw zong na hong seam ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa ka Pathian ka patoai natu in biakinn khat ka sak laitak hi. Tua mun sia mun thiangtho hi tu a, keima le ka mite in zing sim nitak sim, Sabbath ni zongh, Thadet Poaite le a dang ni thiangtho nite ah Topa ih Pathian patoaina in meihal biakpiakna mun hi tu a, tatsat ngawlin ama tungah anluum thiangtho piakna mun, hel namtui, ngimnamtui tuatuamte halna taw ama ka biana mun hi tu hi. Tusia a tawntungin vawt tu in Topa in Israel te thupia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ih Pathian in pathian dang khat pawpo sangin lianzaw ahikom biakinn lian khat sak tu ka sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahizong vantung zaina theampo ngawngawn in ama tasak zo ngawl tu ahikom kuama in Pathian atu biakinn sa thei tatak ngawl tu hi. Tuasia ci leang Pathian tungah ngimnamtui hal natu mun ci tung kaan keima in bangbang biakinn khat sa thei tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu in khetlet lim ngelh thiamna nei a, khamh, ngunn, taau le thik a zeamthiam, vancii meal, a sandup le a san puannip a thiam pasal khat hong puak ta'n. Ama in Judah le Jerusalem ah ka pa David ii tealsa khut thiamna nei te taw seam khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma ii thingvawt nasep thiamzia ka heak ahikom Lebanon panin cedar thing, cypress thing le juniper thingluangte hong puak ta'n. Thing tam tatak vawtkholna ah na mihingte a hu tu in ka mihing puak tu in kinging khi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />banghang ziam cile sak tu a ka tup biakinn sia lian tu a, hoi mama tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na thing atte neak tu in zungtaang tann tulnii, mangtaang tann tul nii, sapittui litre tulzali le olive thau litre tulzali kong puak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiram kumpipa in Solomon tungah lai thuk kik hi. A lai sungah, “ Topa in a mite a it hu in nangma sia amate kumpi hong suaksak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leitung le vantung a bitphua pa Israel te Topa Pathian pok vun! Tu in Topa atu biakinn khat le ama a tu kumpi inn khat sak a sawm, heaktheina le thiamna taw a kidim tapa ciim khat, ama in David kumpipa pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huram kici a ciim le khutthiam mama khat kong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nu sia Dan nam pan hi a, a pa sia Tyre khua mi ahi hi. Ama in khamh, ngunn, taau, thik, suang le thing te taw nate koibang piangsak tu ci theampo he siat hi. Ama in vancii, a sandup, a san le puanneal te zongh vawt thei hi. Ama in khetlet thiamna nam tuatuam vawt thei a, ama tungah a kison ngealkhol lim khat pawpo bangin seam thei hi. Na khutthiamte le na pa David kumpipa naseamte taw ama seam khawmsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua hi a, tu in nong kamciamsa zungtaang, mangtaang, sapittui le olive thaute hong puak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lebanon mual te tungah na kisap za cedar thing ih phuk tu a, kopsawm in, phongte vawtin Joppa ciang tuipi tungah kitaaisak tu hi. Tua mun pan nangma in tuate Jerusalem ah na nawn thei tu hi,” ci in at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pa David ii mi simna a vawt bangin Solomon kumpipa in Israel ngam sungah a teang ngamdangmite theampo mi simna vawt hi. Ngamdangmi a vekpi 153,600 teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in tuate sung pan 70,000 sia vanh nawn tu, 80,000 sia mual tungah suang at tu in see a nasep zaw nanak natu in 3,600 te sia naseamte uk tu in panmun pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon ii pa David kumpipa in Biakinnpi atu in a mun tu khat kinging khol zo hi. Tua mun sia Jerusalem khua sung Moriah mualtung Jebus mi Araunah ii ancilna, David kungah Topa kilakna mun ahi hi. Solomon kumpipa ii inn sak tu a kipat hun sia
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama ii kumpi sep zawk a kum li kum tha nii tha sung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa sak Biakinnpi sia metre 27 sau a metre 9 zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Inn sung tumna mailim inndoi sia Biakinnpi zaina taw kikim a, metre 9 zai in metre 54 saang hi. A inndoi sungsang sia khamh ciitak taw kizut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A inndoipi sia cedar thing taw kidal a, khamh pha taw tuamin palm thingkung limte le a kual kipee limte kisuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa in Biakinnpi sia a hoi mama suangmanpha te le Parvaim ngam pan a kilei khamh taw in zeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in biakinn pangte, zawlsaute, tumna lampi le kongkhate sia khamh taw tuam hi. A seamte in a pang tungah cherubim limte ngelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sungsang inndoi, Thiangthobel Mun a kicina sia metre 9 sau in, metre 9 zai a, Biakinnpi zaina za ma hi. Thiangthobel Mun pangte tuamna in khamh tann 20 vaal kizangh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />khamh thikpim vawtna in khamh gram 570 kizangh a, inn tung inndoi pangte zongh khamh taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa in a naseamte zongh Cherubim lim nii thik taw vawt a, khamh taw tuamin, Thiangthobel Mun ah a koi natu thupia hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua munah tuate sia inn sung tumna sang nga in a kicial in ding hi. Khatsim in tha nii veu nei a, a thate khat sia metre 2.2 veu sau a, a thate a inndoi laizang ah a kipha in kiphal hi, tuabangin metre 9 bang a zai a inndoi dim in a pangh lang le lang dong a tha in pha siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A Thiangthobel Mun atu in puanneal le a dang taw puankhai khat kivawt a, vancii, a sandup le a san taw kinimh in, a tungah cherubim lim kisuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa in metre 15.5 veu a saang khuam nii vawtsak a, Biakinnpi mai ah phut hi. Khuam khat in metre 2.2 a saang a dawnbawk khat veu nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuamte ii dawn sia thik kipheak te le taau taw kivawt talee nga lim zakhat taw kizeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua khuamte biakinn tumna panghte ah kiphut a: thangsang a om khuam sia Jachin, saksang a om khuam sia Boaz kici hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in king khat metre 9 veu a zai, a saanna metre 4.5 a pha, king li nei biaknatau khat taau taw vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in metre 2.2 a thuk, a khuangmai zaina metre 4.4 a pha, a kiimkot sauna metre 13.2 a pha, taau tuikuang beam khat zongh vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuikuang ngongvang puasang a king kiimkot ah a kithuap ngual nii in zeam hi. A zepnate sia khuital lim hi a, tuikuang taw sa khat in a kisung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua tuikuang sia a puasang a nga, taau khuital sawm le nii te nungzaang ah kinga a, tua khuitalte in thum sim veu in ngatna khat tek nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuikuang panghte sia millimetre 75 saa hi. A ngong sia haingong taw kibang a, paakpalh bangin a puasang ah deal hi. Tuikuang sungah tui litre 60,000 bang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in kuangtung sawm zongh vawtin nga sia Biakinnpi thangsang ah koi in, a saksang ah nga koi hi. Tuate sia sangaw biakpiakna in a kihal sabakte silna in zak tu ahi hi. Kuangpui sungah tui sia thiampite kisil natu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a vawt ngei bangin khamh meidetna khuam sawm le sabuai sawm vawtin Biakinnpi ii a lai inndoi sungah koi in, a lang le lang ah meidetna khuam nga le sabuai nga veu kikoi hi. Khamh khawbeam zakhat zongh kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in thiampite atu in a sungsang leitual vawt a, a puasang leitual khat zongh vawt hi. A kilaklaw ah a om kongpite ii kongkhate sia taau taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuikuang sia Biakinnpi ii nisuana thangsang king nai ah kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huram in bealte, kawkeaute le khawbeamte zongh vawt hi. Ama in Biakinnpi atu in, Solomon kumpipa tungah a vawt tu a kamciamsa nate theampo vawt siat a: Khuam nii Khuam dawn ah kuang taw a kibang khuam dawnbawk nii Khuam dawnbawk sim ii tungah a kipheak thikkualte Khuam dawnbawk khat sim kiimkot ngual nii in, a kingual taau talee nga zali Khuileang sawm Kuangtung sawm Tuikuang Tuikuang ngakna khuital sawm le nii Bealte, kawkeaute le thikkeaukaate ahi hi. Khutthiam syapipa Huram in hi vanhte theampo sia Solomon kumpipa thupiak bangin Topa Biakinnpi sungah zak tu in taaunawtsa taw in vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa in hi teng theampo sia Sukkoth le Zeredah kilaklaw Jordan kuam taau seakna munah vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A vawtsa na tam mama ahikom taau a kizangh theampo ii ngitna kuama in he zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in Biakinnpi a zak tu a cingin khamh van zakte zong vawt hi: biaknatau le Topa atu biakpiakna anluum sabuaite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngealna om bangin meidetna khuamte le Thiangthobel Mun mai ah det tu khamh pha taw a kivawt meiinnte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />paak zepna te, meiinnte, taitee te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />meiinn ciang te, kuangte, ngimnamtui halna pakante le meikam toaina bealpeute ahi hi. Hi nazakte a vekpi in khamh ciitak taw kivawt hi. Biakinnpi puasang kongkhate le Thiangthobel Mun sang kongkhate sia khamh taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in Biakinnpi vai nasep teng a man siat zawkciangin a pa David ii Topa tungah a aapsa nate — ngunn, khamh le a dang nazakte theampo biakinn vanh kholna inndoite sungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang Solomon kumpipa in Israel namte le a bee a phungte ii lampuite theampo sia David Khuapi Zion panin Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang Biakinnpi ah a pua tu in Jerusalem ah a kikhop natu sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate a vekpi in Buk Poai vawt hunin kikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lampui theampo a cin zawkciangin Levi mite in Thuciamna Thingkuang domto in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Biakinnpi ah puak uh hi. Thiampite le Levi mite zongh in Topa ompuina Puanbuk le a vanh theampo Biakinnpi ah tua siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa le Israel mite theampo Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah kikhawm in tuu le khui honpui khat — a kisim zo ngawl za dongin a tam taw sangaw biakpiakna nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaciang Thiampite in Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang pua in Biakinnpi sungah tumpui a, Thiangthobelna Mun Cherubim nuai ah koi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tha kiphalte in Thingkuang le a puakna molte liap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A puakna molte ii mongte sia Thiangthobel Mun mai santak ah a ding khat pawpo in mu thei a, ahihang mundang pan kimu thei ngawl hi. (Tua molte tuni dongin om lai hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang sungah, Israel mite Egypt ngam pan hong pai in Topa taw thuciamna a vawt lai a, Moses ii Sinai mual tung, tualai ah a koi suangpheakte nii simngawl bangma dang om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thiampite a om theampo sia akua pawl akua pawl ci om tuan ngawlin amate le amate kithiansua tek uh hi. Tua zawkciang Levi mi music thiamte — Asaph, Heman le Jeduthun le amate ii bee le phungte sung mite theampo — puanneal silh uh hi. Levi mite sia biaknatau nisuana sang nai ah daalkopsai le tengtonghte taw ding in, amate taw thiampite 120 sia lemle tumin om uh hi. La sate in lemle, daalkopsai le a dang tumtheite taw aw kihual tatakin Topa pok in lasa hi: “ Topa pok vun, banghang ziam cile ama pha hi, Hong itna kip tawntung hi.” Thiampite ii Biakinnpi a nusiat po ciang tuasia Topa ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia le a taang meeikaai khat taw thakhatin kidim a, amate in biakna zom thei nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Solomon kumpipa thungen a, “ Topa awng meei sung le khuazing sungah teen tu na teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A tawntungin na teen natu mun ahi, tu in, a tuanngen biakinn khat kong saksak zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua munah Israel mipite theampo ding uh hi. Kumpipa in amate sang maingatin amate atu Pathian thupha ngetsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in “Israel Topa Pathian pok vun! Ama in ka pa David tungah a kamciam keamcing a, ama in ka pa tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Egypt pan ka mite ka pusua pui hun pan kipan tu dong Israel ngam sungah keima hong kibiak natu mun biakinn khat sak natu in khuapi khat pawpo ka teal bua a, Israel ka mite lampui tu in khat pawpo zongh ka teal bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang tu in keima nong biak natu mun Jerusalem ka teal zo a, ka mite uk tu in nangma David kong teal zo hi.’ ci hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon in, “Ka pa David in Israel te ii Topa Pathian biak natu in biakinn khat sak tu ngeal hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ahihang Topa in ama tungah, ‘Kei atu biakinn khat na sak nop sia maan hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ahizong nangma in na sa ngei buatu hi. Ka biakinn sa tu sia na tapa, nangma ii tapa tatak hi,’ ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tu in Topa in a kamciam taangtungsak zo hi: keima in ka pa ii Israel kumpi za ka laih zo a, Israel Topa Pathian biak natu in biakinn khat ka sa zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Israel mite taw a vawt thuciamna tepteena suangpheakte omna Thuciamna Thingkuang sia Biakinnpi sungah ka koi zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang mihonte omna biaknatau mai ah Solomon pai in ding a, a khutte laamin thungen hi. (
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon in dawtuam khat taau taw vawtin leitual laizang ah koi hi. Tua kingli nei dawtuam sia king khat metre 2.2 veu zai in, metre 1.3 saang hi. Ama in hi dawtuam tungah kaato in mi sim ii mu theina munah khupdin in a khutte vantung sangah laamto hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in, “Israel ii Topa Pathian awng, vantung le leitung theampo ah nangma taw a kibang pathian dang om ngawl hi. Na mite taw na thuciamna na kholet a, tuaciang a thin tatak taw na thu hong ni in a nuntak ciang na itna amate tungah na lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka pa David tungah na kamciamte na kholet hi; tu ni in kammalte theampo taangtung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu in Israel Topa Pathian awng, ama ii na Thukham hong zui bangin amate in kidopna taw zui pole, na suan na paalte sung pan khat in Israel kumpi in maang tawntung tu hi ci a, ka pa tungah kamciam na vawt dang khat sia zongh nong taangtutsak natu thu kong ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu in Israel ii Topa Pathian awng, na naseampa David tungah kamciam na piakte theampo taangtungsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ahihang, Oh Pathian awng, nang leitung mihingte sungah teang thei takpi tu ni ziam? Vantung theampo zongh nang hong huam tu in lian tham ngawl hi, tua ahikom hi Biakinnpi keima sak sia lian khom thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa ka Pathian awng, keima na naseampa khi hi. Ka thungetna hong ngai ta'n. Kong ngetnate hong pia ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi Biakinnpi a sun a zanin na cing in. Hisia nang hong kibiak natu mun hi ci in nong kamciamsa hi, tua ahiciang hi Biakinnpi sang nga in thu kong nget ciangin hong za ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kei ii thungetnate le na Israel mite ii hi mun maingat in a thungetnate hong za ta'n. Vantung na inn sung panin hong za ta'n a, ko hong maisak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihing khat sia midang khat tungah khial hi ci a kimawsiat in, a maw ngawl hunlam a kiciam tu in hi Biakinnpi sung na biaknatau ah a kipaipui ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Oh Topa , vantung panin na ngai in a, na naseamte tungah thu khen in. A maw sia tungah a kiphu bangin daan pia in, a maw ngawl sia suaktasak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na Israel mite sia nangma tungah hong khial hu in a ngalte in zo a, tuasia ciang nang sang hong heak in, hi Biakinnpi ah pai a, amate kiniamkhiakin maw maisak natu in thu hong ngen le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />vantung panin na ngai in. Na mite ii mawna khialnate maisak in a, tuaciang amate le a taanghpupite tungah na piaksa ngam le lei ah na paipui kik in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na mite nang tungah hong maw hu in nguatui na hansak ciang le, amate kisiik in hi Biakinnpi sang nga in kiniamkhiakin thu hong nget ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Oh, Topa awng, vantung panin ngai in a, na naseamte le Israel mite ii mawna khialnate na maisak in, tuaciang a maan a sep natu amate na hil in. Tuaciang Oh Topa , na mite ii a tawntung a neisa tu in na piak hi na leitang tungah nguatui puak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Ngam sungah kialpi, ahibuale natsia a tung ahizong, ankungte vuisa ahibuale khaumaw hon in a lalsak ciang ahizong, na mite a ngalte in a sim ciang ahizong, amate sungah natna satna a om ciang ahizong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />amate ii thungetna na ngai in. Israel na mite khat pawpo in a thin hee lawlawm man po in, hi Biakinnpi sangah a khut uh zan in thu hong ngen le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />amate ii thungetna na za in. Vantung na inn sung panin amate na ngai in a, na maisak in. Nangma bekma in mihingte thinsung ngaisutnate he ni hi. mi simin ama taw a kiphu bangin a tungah na vawt in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tuasia ciangin koma taanghpupite tungah na piaksa ngam sungah a teen hun sung theampo amate in nangma hong zakta in na thu hong ni tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“A khuala a teang ngamdangmite in na letna, na vaang neina le a seam tu a tawntung na kinginnate za a, hi Biakinnpi ah hong pai in thu hong nget ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />amate thungetnate na ngai in. Vantung na teenna mun pan na za in a, vawtsak tu in hong nget teng na vawtsak in, tua hile leitung mite theampo te in Israel na mite ii hong heak bangin hong he thei in, na thu hong ni tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang amate in hi Biakinnpi nang atu ka sak sia nangma biak natu mun ahi hunlam he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“A ngalte taw kido tu in na mite kuanin na sawl a, amate in nang tungah thu hong nget ciang, koisung po ah a om zong na tealsa hi khuapi le nang atu ka sak hi Biakinnpi sang hong nga in thu hong ngen le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />amate ii thungetnate na ngai in. Vantung panin na za in a, amate zawna na pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Na mite in mawna hong vawt ciang — a maw ngawl kuama om ngawl ahiciang — na thin uukin a ngalte in zosak a, ngamdang ah thongtaak tu in a paipui ciangin tua ngam sia a khuala ta zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />na mite ii thungetnate ngai in. Tua ngam pan amate kisiik kikin a mawna le a seksolna pualaak in thu hong ngen le, amate thungetnate na ngai in, Oh ka Topa awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ngam ah amate in thintak le a maan takin kisiik in, ka taanghpupite tungah na piak hi ngam, na tealsa hi khuapi, nang atu ka sak hi Biakinnpi maingat in thu hong ngen le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tuasia ciang amate ii thungetnate na ngai in. Vantung na inn sung panin amate thungetna na za in a, tuaciang amate hesuakin, na mite ii a mawna a khialna te theampo na maisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Oh ka Pathian awng, tu in kote hong en ta'n a, hi mun pan kong thungetnate hong ngai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Topa Pathian awng, tu in thoto in a, na vaangletna lim ahi Thuciamna Thingkuang taw Biakinnpi sungah tumin hi sungah a tawntungin om in. Na thiampite a nasepna theampo ah thupha pia in a, amate tungah na phatna hangin na mite theampo lungdam tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Topa Pathian awng, na tealsa kumpipa nial heak in. Na naseampa David tungah na nei itna phawk tawntung in,” ci in thungen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in a thunget a man ciangin vantung pan meikuang hong paisuk a, sangaw biakpiaknate kaanghtum in, Topa ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia Biakinnpi dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Biakinnpi sia tua khuavak taang velvol sia taw kidim ahikom thiampite a sungah tum thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite in Biakinnpi ah van panin meikuang taaksuk le khuavak taang a dim a mu uh ciang a lam totna tungah a lu kunin Pathian bia a, a phatna le a itna kip pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Solomon le mite theampo in Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in kipawlkhop biakpiakna in khui 22,000 le tuu 120,000 pia hi. Tuabangin ama le mipite in Biakinnpi aapna nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thiampite sia a kiseena mun tek ah ding a, amate maingat in Levi te dingin David kumpipa ii piak tumthei tuatuamte taw, “Ama hong itna in kip tawntung hi!” ci in lasa a David sawlna om bangin Topa pok uh hi. Thiampite ii lemle a tum sung teng mipi theampo ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon in Biakinnpi mai leitual laizang a thiansua zawkciang tua munah pumhal sangaw biakpiakna, antang taw biakpiakna le kipawlkhop biakpiaknate panin a thau te pia hi. Hi bang a vawtna sia ama vawt taau biaknatau sia hi biakpiaknate theampo atu in no lei ahihang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Solomon le Israel mite theampo in ni sali sung Buk Poai khaam uh hi. Tua poai ah mihonpi hong pai a, saksang ah Hamath Mualciangh le thangsang ah Egypt ngamngi dong a teang mite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in ni sali sung biaknatau aapna vawtin tua zawkciang a dang ni sali sung ma poai vawt thua uh hi. A ni khakbel ni in amate in poai manna vawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a zing ciang tha sali tha ni 23 ni in Solomon in mipite inn ah ciasak hi. Topa ii a Israel mite tung, David tung le Solomon tungah thupha theampo a piak manin amate lungdam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in Biakinnpi le kumpi inn a sak teng man zo a, tuate atu a ngealna theampo pha takin a zaw thiang sitset zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama tungah zanin Topa kilangh hi. Topa in ama tungah, “Na thungetna ka za zo a, hi Biakinnpi sia ka tungah sangaw biakpiaknate nong nei natu munin ka saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nguatui ka hansak po ciang ahibuale lo ante a ne khawng tu in khaumawte ka paisak po ciang ahibuale ka mite tungah a kilaw thei natna khat ka tunsak po ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />amate in kei tungah thungenin kisiik kikin a tatsiat ngamtatnate a nungngat le, tuaciang a thungetnate vantung pan ka za tu a, a mawnate maisak in a ngam a lei ngamnuam ka suaksak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi Biakinnpi ka mitsuan tu a, hi mun panin thungetnate theampo a za tu in ka kinging tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />banghang ziam cile hi Biakinnpi ka tealsa hi a, a tawntungin keima hong kibiakna mun tu in ka thiansua sa ahi hi. Tuasia ka mitsuan tu a, a tawntungin ka hung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na pa David ii sep bangin ka thukhamte zui in na tungah kong sawlte theampo seamin thumaan takin ka na na seam le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />na suan na paalte in Israel ngam uk tawntung tu hi ci a, na pa David tungah ka son, ka kamciam sia ka len tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang nangma le na mite in nangma tungah kong piak thukhamte le thupiakte zui ngawlin pathian dangte na bia uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />kong piaksa ngam panin kong heam tu hi, tuaciang keima hong kibiak natu mun tu in ka thiansua sa, hi Biakinnpi ka nusia tu hi. Israel sia mihing theampo in zawnsak vawtin ngaimaw tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tu in tua Biakinn nasia takin kipatoai ahihang tuasia a kaantan pawpo in lamdang sa in, ‘Banghangin Topa in hi ngam le hi Biakinnpi tungah hi bangza in vawt ziam?’ ci in dongh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mipite in ‘A taanghpupite Egypt ngam pan a pusua pui Topa a Pathian a nusiat hang hi. Amate in pathian dangte pom in bia uh hi. Tuasia hangin Topa in hi tuasiatna teng amate tungah tungsak hi,’ ci in zo tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in Biakinnpi le a kumpi innte kum kul sung sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Hiram kumpipa ii a piak khuapite zongh pua kik a tua khuapite sungah Israel mite puakin teangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Hamath le Zobah ngam la in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />sennealngam a om Palmyra khuapi sia kulh taw uum hi. Ama a ankholna mun tu in Hamath ngam ah khuapite theampo pua kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Solomon in a nuai a khuapite zongh pua kik hi: Beth Horon Tungnung le Beth Horon Nuainung, (a kikalh thei kongpite a nei, ngal dalna kulh taw ki uum khuapite hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Baalath khuapi, ankholna khuapi theampo le a siphute le a siphu ngalleangte koina khuapite ahi hi. Ama in Jerusalem khua, Lebanon ngam le a ukna ngamsung theampo ah sak tu in a tup a sawm theampo taangtun siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel te ii Canaan ngam a laak lai in a thalup ngawl Canaan mite ii suan le paal teng sia Solomon in zawthawk thu taw sawlin naseamsak hi. Hite sungah Hit mi, Amor mi, Periz mi, Hiv mi le Jebus mite kihel in a suan a paalte sia tu hun dongin sila hi suak lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel mite sia zawthawk thu taw na kiseamsak ngawl ahihang ngalkap, ulian, siphu ngalleang uk le siphu ngalkap nasep kiseamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inn sakna tuatuamte ah zawthawk thu taw a kisawl naseamte uk tu in ulian 250 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon in Egypt kumpipa tanu a zi sia David Khuapi pan ama atu a sak inn sia ah khiin hi. Solomon in, “Ama sia Israel kumpipa David kumpi inn ah teang thei ngawl het hi, banghang ziam cile Thuciamna Thingkuang omna pawpo thiangtho hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomon in Biakinnpi mai ah a sak biaknatau tungah Topa atu in sangaw biakpiaknate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Moses Thukham bangin meihal biakpiaknate ni thiangtho ni sim atu in pia hi: Sabbath nite, Thadet Poaite le kum sim a kivawt poai thumte — Tol kisaw ngawl Anluum Poai, Anlaak Poai le Buk Poai te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pa David ii zui tu a vawt ngeinate zui in thiampite ii ni sim a nasep tu le lasakna le a nasepna ah thiampite a hu Levi mite ii a nasep tu sia ama in vaihawmsak hi. Pathian mi David ii thupiak bangin biakinn cingte in a vaipuak neina kongpi tek ah ni sim a nasep natu in pawl khensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David ii thiampite le Levi mite tungah vanh kholna innte le a dangte taw kisai in a thupiakte kheet nei ngawlin kivawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi hun in Solomon ii nasepna theampo kizo thiang hi. Topa Biakinnpi tawdap a kiphu pan kipanin a zaw thiang dong nasep theampo ah a kisuangsamh mun om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Solomon sia Edom ngam, Aqaba Tuidok hui ah a om teambaw tawlngakna te ahi Eziongeber le Elath ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiram kumpipa in a khutnuai uliante ii a uk le teambaw naseam thiamsate ii a zui teambawte Solomon puak hi. Amate in Solomon ii uliante taw Ophir ngam ah paikhawmin Solomon tungah khamh kilogramme 15,000 vaal puak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sheba kumpinu in Solomon kumpipa minthanna za a thudokna haksate taw ama ze et tu in Jerusalem ah haw hi. Ama in a lalangte honpui khat le hel namtuite, suangmanphate le khamh tam mama a pua kalaoh te keng hi. Solomon taw a kimu uh ciang ama in a thu ngaisut thei theampo dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in tuate zo thei siat hi; ama ii a zo kik tu in thu haksa leih bangma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sheba kumpinu in Solomon ii ciimna he a, a sak sa kumpi inn zongh mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in kumpi sabuai tungah a kilui ante, a uliante teenna innte, kumpi inn sung a naseamte omzia le a kibang a puansilhte, poai vawt ni in ama a cing a naseamte ii puansilhte le Biakinnpi ah a piak biakpiaknate mu hi. Tuate ama in lamdang sa in ingh liang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in kumpipa tungah, “Ka ngam panin na ciimna le na thu ka zaakte maan hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima mama hong pai in ka mu matengin ngual ii hong sonte ka um bua hi. Na ciimna ii a lang zongh a za ngawl khi hi. Ngual hong sonna sangin ciimzaw lai ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma taw omkhawm tawntungin na hong sepsak mite, ciim kam na pauna a zate sia bang zata in hampha ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa na Pathian pok in! Ama min suangin a uk kumpipa hong suasak ciang nang tungah ama bangza in lungkim ziam ci in hong lak hi. Ama in a Israel mite it a, a tawntungin a kep nopna hu in, thukham le thutang khenna na kipsak thei natu in nangma sia amate ii kumpi hong suaksak zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in Solomon kumpipa tungah a ken letsongte: khamh kilogramme 4,000 vaal le hel namtuite le suangmanpha tam mama pia hi. Sheba kumpinu ii Solomon kumpipa tungah a piak hel namtuite sangin a phazaw dang om ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />(Ophir pan khamh hong paipui Hiram kumpipa le Solomon kumpipa ii mihingte in juniper thing le suangmanpha te zongh paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon in tua thingte sia Biakinnpi le ama kumpi inn keallei vawtna, music thiamte atu tengtongh le liamlo te vawtna in zangh hi. Tua masia in Judah ngam sungah tuabang te kimu ngeingawl hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in Sheba kumpinu ii a nget theampo pia hi. Hite sia Sheba kumpinu ii ama a piak letsongte a thukna in a piakte ahi hi. Tua zawkciang ama le a lalangte Sheba ngam ah heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in kum simin khamh kilogramme 23,000 dektak nga a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />sumvawtte le sumbukte ii phiangshia a piakte ban ah a nga ahi hi. Arabia kumpite le Israel ngamkhen ukte zongh in ngunn le khamh puak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon in ngaldalna lumlian 200 vawtin lum khat ciangin a kiseak khamh kilogramme 7 bang taw tuam hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuaciang ngaldalna lum a no zaw 300 vawt a, khat ciangin a kiseak khamh kilogramme 3 bang taw tuam hi. Ama in tuate a vekpi in Lebanon Thingtaam Khaanpui sungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa in kumpi tokhum lian mama khat zongh vawt hi. Tua tokhum khen khat sia saiha taw kituam a, a dang teng sia khamh ciitak taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua tokhum tungah a kaa natu in keallei dawl luk pha khat kidaw a, khamh taw a kituam dinpha khat kibel in om hi. To khum lang le lang ah khut ngakna om a, tawpi lim khat veve dingsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keallei dawl luk te khat sim ii lang le lang ah tawpi lim 12 om hi. Hi bang kumpi tokhum sia kumpi ngam mundang peuma ah om ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa ii zak haite theampo khamh taw kivawt a, Lebanon Thingtaam Khaanpui sungah a kikoi vanhzak kuang le keau te theampo sia khamh ciitak veu hi. Solomon hun lai in ngunn sia a man nei in kingaisun ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon in Hiram kumpipa ii teambawte taw a paikhawm tuipi teambaw honkhat nei hi. Kum thum simin ama teambawte hong heak kik ciang khamh, ngunn, saiha, mei nei ngawl zawngpuite le zawngte hong pua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa sia leitung kumpi dangte sangin ciimzaw a hauzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian ii a piak ciimna thu he nuamin tua kumpite theampo in ama thu dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate khat simin Solomon atu letsongte — khamh, ngunn, puantualte, ngalhiamte, hel namtuite, siphute le laate puak hi. Kum khat zawk kum khat tuabangin kizom suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in a siphu ngalleang le a siphute koi natu in siphu khawk 4,000 le siphu ngalkap 12,000 zongh nei hi. Tuate pawlkhat sia Jerusalem ah keam in a taanglai teng khuapi dangte ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama sia Euphrates Ngun panin Philistia le Egypt ngamngi dong a om kumpi theampo a ukpipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama kumpi in a maan lai in Jerusalem ah ngunn sia suang bangin tam a cedar thingkung sia Judah mualpeangte ah a om sycomore thingkung thawthongte bangin tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Solomon in siphute Musri le ngamdang theampo panin lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Solomon ii taanghthu dang teng sia a kipat pan a tawpna dong Kamsaang Nathan Taanghthu sung, Shiloh khua mi Ahijah ii Kamsaanna sung le Kamsaang Iddo ii Mukholnate sungah kiciamtee a, tua te Israel kumpipa Jeroboam ii kumpi maanna thu taw zongh kizom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Solomon in Israel ngam buppi sia Jerusalem khua panin kum sawmli sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama thi a, David Khuapi sungah kiphumin a tapa Rehoboam in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam sia ama kumpi suaksak tu in Saksang Israel mite theampo ii kikhopna Shechem ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa kung pan suakta in Egypt ngam ah a tai Nebat ii tapa Jeroboam in tua thu a zaak ciang inn ah cia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saksang namte pan mite in ama sam a, a vekpi in Rehoboam kungah pai in ama tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na pa in ko tungah vanhngit hong suan hi. Hi vanhngitte nong zaangsak zaw a, ko atu in nuntakna nong olsak zaw le nangma khutnuai ah a thumaan mi hi tu khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rehoboam in, “Hi thu ka ngaisut natu in ni thum hun hong pia tavun. Tua zawkciang hong pai kik tavun,” ci in zo kik hi. Tua ahiciang mipite in nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa Rehoboam in a pa Solomon tungah ngaisutna a pia uhaamte, thu dongh hi. Ama in, “Hi mite tungah bangbangin a kam zo tu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in, “Hi mite tungah dik lete a, amate lungkim natu in thu hong dokte kikhualna taw zo lete, thumaan takin na na hong sepsak tawntung tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang ama in uhaamte ngaisut piakna melsia a, ama taw a khangkhawm, tu in ngaisutna a piate ahi khangmoite kungah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka ngamtat natu in bang ngaisutna hong pia tu nu ziam? A vanhngit uh zaangsak zaw tu in hong ngen mite tungah bangbang ci tu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in, “Tua mite tungah hi bangin ci in: ‘Ka khutmeleng sia ka pa kawng sangin saa zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka pa in no vanhngit hong suan hi; keima in tua vanhngitte a ngit zaw lai in ka vawt tu hi. Ama in khauhual kibul ciang taw hong saat hi; kei ka hi le siphu saatna taw hong vel tu khi hi!,’ ” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni thum zawkciang Jeroboam le mipite theampo Kumpipa Rehoboam kungah ama sawl bangin hong heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa in uhaamte ii ngaisutna a piakte melsia in mipite tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />khangmoizawte ii ngaisut piak bangin kamham pau hi. Ama in, “Ka pa in vanhngit hong suan hi; tuate a ngit zaw lai in ka vawt tu hi. Ama in khauhual kibul ciang taw hong saat hi; kei ka hile siphu velna taw kong vel tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuasia in Shiloh pan kamsaang Ahijah tungtawn a, Nebat tapa Jeroboam tungah a sonna a taangtun natu in Topa Pathian ii deina ahi hi. Hisia hu in kumpipa in mipite bangma thudon ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipite in kumpipa ii amate a thudon ngawl a mu ciangin, “David le a innkuan te taak hen! Ei atu amate in bang hong vawtsak ngei na ziam? Israel mite awng, cia tek ka tawng! Rehoboam ama le ama ki en tahen!” ci in au uh hi. Tuabangin Israel mite in leedo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rehoboam sia Judah ngam sungah a teangte bek ii kumpipa tu in nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Kumpipa Rehoboam in zawthawk thu taw a kisawl nasepna a uk Adoniram samin Israel te kungah paisak hi, ahihang amate in ama suang taw deanglum uh hi. Tuasia ciang Rehoboam sia a siphu ngalleang tungah manlang takin kaato a, Jerusalem khua ah suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua hun pan kipan Israel saksang kumpi ngammite in David kumpi khangngui langpanin leedo tan uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam kumpipa Jerusalem a thet ciang, Judah le Benjamin namte sung pan ngalkap thiambel 180,000 khawm hi. Ama in saksang ah a teang Israel minamte simin uk kik sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahizong Topa in kamsaang Shemaiah tungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa Rehoboam le Judah le Benjamin namte theampo tungah hi thu puak in sawl hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na Israel mipuite sim heak vun. Na vekpi na inn tek ah cia vun. Hi bangin thupiang sia keima deina hi.” Amate in Topa thupiak ni in Jeroboam sim tu in pai nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rehoboam sia Jerusalem ah om lai a, Judah le Benjamin ngam sungah a om, a nuai a khuapite kulh taw uumsak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethlehem, Etam, Tekoa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bethzur, Soco, Adullam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gath, Mareshah, Ziph,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adoraim, Lachish, Azekah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zorah, Aijalon le Hebron te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in hi khuapite sia nasia takin kulh taw uum a, khua sim ah a uk khat tek koi in, tua zawkciang ama in khua sim ah an, olive thau le sapittui,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuaciang lum le teite zongh koi hi. Hi bangin ama in Judah le Benjamin ama ukna nuai ah keam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel ngam theampo panin thiampite le Levi te sia thangsang Judah ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jeroboam le a zalaihte in Levi mite sia Topa thiampite bangin a sepsak nop ngawl hu in Levi te in nganthana le a leitang dang teng nusia in Judah ngam le Jerusalem ah kikhiin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeroboam in doai sepna munte ah a seam tu le doai te le khuitalno lim in a vawt milimte biakna ah naseam tu in ama aituam thiampite panmun pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel te ii nam theampo sung panin Topa , Israel ii Pathian a bia nuam takpi te in Topa , a taanghpupite ii Pathian tungah sangaw biakpiakna a piak thei natu in Jerusalem ah Levi mite zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi sia in Judah kumpi ngam thahatsak a, kum thum sung Solomon tapa Rehoboam tha pia in, David kumpipa le Solomon kumpipa uk sungah a om bangma in nungta in panpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rehoboam in Mahalath teenpui hi, Mahalath ii pa sia David ii tapa Jerimoth hi a, a nu sia Eliab ii tanu Abihail hi a, Jesse ii tunu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in tapa thum nei a, Jeush, Shemariah le Zaham te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua nungciang ama in Absalom ii tanu Maacah teenpui a, amate in tapa li nei a: Abijah, Attai, Ziza le Shelomith te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehoboam in a vekpi zi sawm le liat le zino sawmluk nei a, tapa kul le liat le tanu sawmluk nei hi. A zite le a zinote theampo sung pan ama in Maacah itbel hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ama in a ta dangte theampo sung pan Maacah taw a nei a tapa Abijah it tuamin a kumpi za laih tu in teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rehoboam in a tapate tungah nasepte pha tak seesak a, Judah le Benjamin ngamsung theampo, kulh taw a ki uum khuapite ah koi hi. Ama in amate atu haza ngawlin a dei bang ngo takin pia a, zi tam mama zongh puisak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam in a kumpi thuneina a kip zawk po ma ciang ama le a mite theampo in Topa Thukham nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rehoboam in a kumpi maan zawk a kum nga kumin Topa tungah a thumaan ngawl hu in amate daan kipia hi. Egypt kumpipa Shishak in Jerusalem sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />siphu ngalleang 1,200 siphu ngalkap 60,000 le Libyan, Sukki le Ethiopia ngalkap te a kihel ngalkap a kisim zo ngawl taw sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in kulh taw a ki uum Judah khuapite la in Jerusalem khua dong nawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Shishak khut sung pan a suatak natu in Jerusalem ah a kikhawm Rehoboam kumpipa le Judah lampuite kungah kamsaang Shemaiah pai in, amate tungah “ Topa ii no atu thupuak sia hi bang hi: ‘Keima nong nusiat uh bangma tu in note Shishak khut sungah kong nusia zo hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa le tua lampuite in maw zo khu hi ci a, amate in “ Topa ii sepna maan hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in hi thu a mu ciang Shemaiah kungah a son kikna pan, “A mawna pualaak ahiciang amate ka susia buatu hi. Ahihang Shishak in a sim ciang a suakta valiai bekma hi tu uh hi. Jerusalem in ka thin uuk tutna a cingin thuak ngawl tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ahizong Shishak in amate zothal tu a, amate in keima na a sep le leitung ngamukte ii na a sep, a kilamdanna he tu uh hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Shishak kumpipa pai in Biakinnpi pan le kumpi inn panin sum le vanh manphate la hi, ama in na theampo la in, a laaksak sungah Solomon kumpipa vawt khamh lumte zongh kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuate laih natu in Rehoboam in taau lumte vawtin kumpi inn kongpi cing ngalkap bute tungah aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa Biakinnpi ah a pai simin a cingte in lumte pua in, tuasia zawkciang a cingte ii inndoi ah koi kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in Topa tungah kiniamkhiak ahikom Topa thin uukna in ama susia bup ngawl a, Judah atu in na te a dik a pha in piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rehoboam in Jerusalem pan uk a, a kumpi hina vaang khang hi. Ama kumpi a sua laitakin kum 41 pha a, Israel ngam bup pan Topa in ama biak natu a teal Jerusalem khuapi pan ama in kum sawm le kum sali sung uk hi. Rehoboam ii nu sia Ammon ngam pan Naamah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rehoboam in thusia vawt hi, banghang ziam cile ama in Topa deina zong ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rehoboam ii ngamtatnate a kipatna pan a tawpna dong le a innkuan thutepteena sia Kamsaang Shemaiah Taanghthu le Kamsaang Iddo Taanghthu sungah kimu hi. Rehoboam le Jeroboam sia khat le khat kido tan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rehoboam thi in David Khuapi sung kumpi thaan ah kiphum a, a tapa Abijah in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jeroboam ii kumpi maanna a kum sawm le kum liat kum in Abijah sia Judah kumpi suak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang ama in Jerusalem khua pan kum thum sung ngam uk hi. A nu sia Gibeah khuapi pan Uriel ii tanu Micaiah hi. Abijah le Jeroboam kilaklaw ah ngal piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abijah in ngalkaphonpi 400,000 khawm a, tuaciang Jeroboam in ngalkaphonpi 800,000 taw nang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ephraim mualtung ngam ah a ngalkaphonpite kisi uh hi. Zemaraim Mual ah Abijah kumpipa paito in, Jeroboam le Israel mite oksan a: “Hong ngai tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa, Israel ii Pathian in David taw a kipalsat thei ngawl thuciamna khat vawt a, David le a suan a paalte sia Israel tungah kumpi seam tawntung tu in kumpi za a piak hunlam he ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nebat ii tapa Jeroboam in a kumpipa Solomon leedo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in a ngina ngawl mihing ngilo te samin, amate in Solomon ii tapa Rehoboam sia amate deina bang a vawt tu in zawthawk thu taw sawl hi, Rehoboam sia amate a nang zo tu in khangmoi leih in a heakna kicing ngawl lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in David suan le paalte tungah a piak a kumpi thuneina sia tu in do tu in na vaihawm uh hi. Ngalkaphonpi tam mama le na pathian tu in Jeroboam ii hong vawtsa khamh khui milimte na nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aaron ii suan le paal, Topa ii thiampite le Levi te na notkeak uh hi. Amate taangin a dang minamte ii vawt bangin thiampite panmun na pia uh hi. Khuital khat ahibuale tuu sali taw hong pai pawpo sia noma pathiante ii thiampi khat a suak tu in ama le ama ki aapsak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ahihang kote in Topa ka Pathian nusia ngawlin ama na ka seam lai uh hi. Aaron suan thiampite in thiampi na seamin Levi te in amate hu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zing sim nitak simin amate in ama tungah ngimnamtui biakpiakna le nganno taw pumhal sangaw biakpiaknate nei uh hi. Amate in zeksa ngeina bangin a thiangtho sabuai tungah anluum biakpiakna pia a, tuaciang nitak simin khamh meivak khuam tungah meiinnte de uh hi. Kote in Topa thupiak bang ka seam uh hi, ahihang note in ama na nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian ama mama kote lampui hi a, ama ii thiampite sia hi sungah lemle taw om in, noma a sim tu in hong sapna lemle tum tu in kinging uh hi. Israel mite awng, na taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa do heak vun! Zo zo ngawl tu nu hi!” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua laitakin Jeroboam in a ngalkapte pawlkhat sia Judah ngalkaphonpite nungsang pan a suam tu in kuansak a, a dang teng in a mai pan pangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah te in a kiim a paam en kawkoai a, amate a ki uumci sia mu uh hi. Amate in Topa tungah hu ngenin au a, thiampite in lemle tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah te au vazak in Abijah lampuina taw ngalsim hi; Pathian in Jeroboam le Israel ngalkaphonpite zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judah te kung pan Israel te tai a, Pathian in Judah mite in amate zothawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abijah le a ngalkaphonpite in Israel te zocip a, — Israel ngalkap phabel tul za nga that uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuabangin Judah mite in Israel tungah zawna nga hi, banghang ziam cile amate in a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa suang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abijah in Jeroboam ii ngalkaphonpi del a, a khuapite pawlkhat sut hi: Bethel, Jeshanah le Ephron, tuaciang, hi khuapite khat sim ii nai ah khuanote ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abijah ii kumpi maan sungin Jeroboam sia thahat kik ngei nawn ngawl hi. A khakbel ciang Topa in ama vaatvawk in thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abijah ahile a tha hat vaial hi. Ama in zi sawm le li nei a, tapa 22 le tanumei sawm le luk te ii pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abijah ii taanghthu dangte, ama sonte le a nasepnate Kamsaang Iddo Taanghthu sungah ki at hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abijah kumpipa thi a, David Khuapi sung kumpi thaan ah kiphum hi. A tapa Asa in a kumpi za laih a, Asa khutnuai ah a ngam sia kum sawm sung kilem in nuam sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa sia a maan le a pha in naseam ahikom Topa , a Pathian lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in ngamdangte biaknataute le a doai sepna mun te phiat a, biakna suangkhuam te saattham in a numeipathian Asherah ii limte phuktan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa deina bang vawt tu le a hil nate le a thupiakte zui tu in Judah mite thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Judah ngamsung khuapi theampo ah doai sepna munte le ngimnamtui halna biaknataute a phiat hu in a kumpi ngam sungah kilemna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi hun sungin ama in Judah khuapite atu ngaldalna kulhte vawt a, Topa in kilemna pia ahikom kum tam mama sung ngal om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Judah mite tungah, “Ih khuapite sia luphungte, khua etna tausaangte, a kikhak thei le a kikalh thei kongpite vawtin ih dal tu hi. Topa ih Pathian ii deina bang ih vawt hu in ih ngam sia pha takin ih len zo hi. Ama in mun theampo ah hong pao hong dal a, ngammuanna hong pia hi” ci hi. Tuabangin amate in vawt a, nuam sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa kumpipa in Judah ngalkaphonpi, lum le tei toai pasal 300,000 nei a, Benjamin ngalkaphonpi lum le thal toai pasal 280,000 nei hi. A vekpi in ngalkap thiamsa le ngalhangte veu ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ethiopia te Zerah a kici pa in ngalkaphonpi awn khat le siphu ngalleang 300 taw Judah ngam sim a, Mareshah khua dong kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asa in ama sim tu in pai a, Mareshah khuahui Zephathah Kuam sungah a panmun tek la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asa in Topa a Pathian tungah thungen a, “ Topa awng, ngalkaphonpi thahat khat na hu bangin a thazawm ngalkaphonpi khat zongh ol takin na hu thei hi. Topa kote Pathian awng tu in hong hu ta'n, banghang ziam cile nangma kong muang kong suang uh a, nangma min suangin hi za in a tam ngalkaphonpite sim tu in ka kuan uh hi. Topa awng nang sia kote Pathian na hi hi; nangma zozo tu in a ki um ngam kuama om ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asa le Judah ngalkaphonpite in Ethiopia ngalkaphonpi a sim ciang Topa in Ethiopia ngalkaphonpi zawsak hi. Amate tai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asa le a ngalkapte in Gerar dong del uh hi. Ethiopia te tam mama kithat ahikom a ngalkaphonpite ngalsim tu in kikaikhawm kik zo ngawl hi. Topa le a ngalkaphonpite in amate zothaw ngawp ahikom a vanh tam mama laaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua munah a om mite in Topa a kiitak lei hu in ama te in Gerar kiim a om khuapite siasak thei uh hi. Tua khuapite theampo ngalkaphonpite in phuul in a vanh tam mama laaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in tuucingte pawlkhat ii ngiaphualte zongh simin tuu le kalaoh tam mama matsak uh hi. Tua zawkciang amate Jerusalem ah heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ii thaa sia Oded ii tapa Azariah tungah theng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang, Azariah sia Asa kumpipa taw kimu tu in pai hi. Ama in, “Asa kumpipa, no Judah mite le Benjamin mite awng, hong ngai tavun! Topa na bel uh laiteng ama in hong ompui tu hi. Ama na zong uh le ama hong musak tu a, ahizong na nungngat uh le ama in hong nusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel sia khuangei hialma Pathian maan nei ngawl a, a hil tu thiampite le thukham zongh nei ngawlin nungta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong a ngim nga uh ciang amate in Topa, Israel te ii Pathian zuan uh hi. Amate in ama zongin mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua hun lai in kuama ngammuangin a vak a cia ngam om ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile ngam theampo ah ngimna le buaina om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in ngimna le heena amate tungah tungsak ahikom minam khat le minam khat, khuapi khat le khuapi khat kinengcip uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahizong note tha hat vun a thinkiam peuma heak vun. Na nasepna thaman hong kipia tu hi,” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa in Oded ii tapa Azariah ii kamsaanna a son sia a zaak ciang tha nga hi. Ama in Judah le Benjamin ngam sungah a om milimte theampo le Ephraim mualtung ngam pan a laak khuapite sungah a om milimte theampo vawk siat hi. Ama in biakinn leitual ah a om Topa ii biaknatau zongh pua kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ephraim, Manasseh le Simeon ngam te panin mi tam mama Asa sangah pai in a kumpi ngam sungah teang uh hi, banghang ziam cile Topa ii ama taw a omkhop hunlam amate in mu uh hi. Asa in amate theampo le Judah le Benjamin mite sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate sia Asa ii kumpi a sep zawk kum sawm le kum nga kum, a tha thum tha in Jerusalem ah kikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in a ngalte vanh a laaksakte sung pan: khui 700 le tuu 7,000 Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna in tua ni in pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thin theampo le a thaa theampo taw a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa biak tu in amate lungkimin thuciamna khat vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A moi a haam ahizong, numei pasal ahizong ama a bia ngawl pawpo thalup tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua thuciamna a kepcing natu in Topa min taw awnging in kiciamna nei hi, tua zawkciang amate au in lemle tum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thin theampo uh taw hi thuciamna vawt zo ahikom Judah mite theampo lungdam uh hi. Topa a biakna ah amate a lungdam uh ciang ama in saang a, mun theampo ah amate kilemna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asa kumpipa in a pi Maacah sia ta a neisak thei Asherah numeipathian milim kiihuai khat a vawt hu in ama ii nu, kumpinu a hina pan heam hi. Asa in tua milim phuktanin ektham a, Kidron kuam sungah a bek teng haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asa in Israel ngamsung doai sepna mun theampo susia siat ngawl ahihang a nuntak sung teng Topa tungah thumaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in Pathian tungah a pa Abijah ii a aap vanhte theampo le ama mama ii a aapsa ngunn le khamh taw a kivawt nate zongh Biakinnpi sungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama ii kumpi maan sung kum 35 kum ciang dong ngal om nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa ii kumpi maanna kum 36 kumin Israel kumpipa Baasha in Judah ngam sim a, Judah ngam ah a tum a pusuak leang theampo a khaam nop manin Ramah sia kulh taw a uum kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Asa in Biakinnpi sumkholnate le kumpi inn pan khamh le ngunn la in Damascus ah Syria kumpipa Benhadad tungah thaak a, hi kam teng vaitha hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ih pate a kipawl bangma in ei zongh kipawl tawng. Hi khamh le ngunnte sia letsong in kong puak hi. Tu in Israel kumpipa Baasha taw na kipawlna sia tatsak vun, tua hile ka ngam pan ama ii ngalkapte ciasak kik tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asa ii kam vaithak sia Benhadad lungkimin, a ngalkapmangte le a ngalkaphonpite Israel khuapite sim tu in paisak hi. Amate in Ijon, Dan, Abel Beth Maacah le ankholna Naphtali khuapite theampo la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baasha kumpipa in tua thu a zaak ciang Ramah khua a kulh vawt tawlnga in a nasep nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Asa kumpipa in Judah ngamsung theampo pan mihing khawmtua in Baasha ii Ramah ah a zak suang le thingte puasakin Geba le Mizpah khuapi kulhte vawtna in zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hunin kamsaang Hanani sia Kumpipa Asa kungah pai a, “ Topa na Pathian suang ngawlin Syria kumpipa na suan zawk hu in Israel kumpipa ii ngalkaphonpi sia nangma khut sung pan suakta zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ethiopia le Libyan te in siphu ngalleang tam mama le siphu ngalkap tam mama taw ngalkaphonpite nei hi ngawl ka na ziam? Ahihang Topa muangin suang na hikom ama in amate hong zosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in ama tungah thumaanna a neite tungah thahatna pia nuam in leitung buppi encik nginge hi. Na mawmawt ngamtatna hu in tu pan kipan ngal do tawntung tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi thu in kamsaangpa tungah Asa thin uuksak mama ahikom ama in kamsaangpa thikkol bulsak hi. Hi hunsung teng mama in Asa in a mite pawlkhat a vawtsiat kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asa ii kumpi maan sungin a piang thute theampo a kipat pan a tawpna dong Judah le Israel Kumpite Taanghthu sungah kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asa ii kumpi a sep a kum 39 kumin a peang ah meima ngilo khatvei in a peang bai hi; ahihang tuasia hun ngawngawn in ama in Topa tungah hu ngen ngawlin syavuante in bawlsak zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawk a kum nii ciang ama thi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David Khuapi sungah ama mama ii khuaksa suangkuul sungah kiphum hi. Amate in a luang phum natu a puuana in a tungah hel namtuite le paaknamtui thau te zut in ama ii thi a khuangaina in a lian mama meimang khat sep uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoshaphat in a pa Asa ii kumpi za laih a Israel te sim tu in ama dinmun khosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in kulh taw a ki uum Judah khuapite sung, Judah ngam nawl sung le a pa ii a laak Ephraim ngamsung khuapite ah a ngalkapte koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehoshaphat in a pa ii kumpi a sua sawng lai bangma in ngamta a, Baal bia ngawl ahikom Topa in thupha pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a pa ii Pathian na seamin Pathian thupiakte zui a, Israel kumpite ngamtat bangin ngamta ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Jehoshaphat sia Judah kumpi ngam kho takin uksak a, a ngammite theampo in letsong a puak tek uh ciang ama hau in nasia takin ki upat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Topa na a sep sia ki angtang in Judah ngam sungah doai sepna munte theampo le Asherah numeipathian limte zongh sumai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama ii kumpi maan zawk a kum thum kumin ama in Judah khuapite ah thuhil tu in a nuai a ulian teng paisak hi: Benhail, Obadiah, Zechariah, Nethanel le Micaiah te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate sia Levi te kua le thiampi nii in zui hi. Levi te sia Shemaiah, Nethaniah, Zebadiah, Asahel, Shemiramoth, Jehonathan, Adonijah, Tobijah le Tobadonijah hi a; thiampite sia Elishama le Jehoram te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in Topa Thukham laibu kengin Judah khuate theampo ah pai in mihonpite hil kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Jehoshaphat kumpipa sia tua a kiim a paam kumpi ngam theampo in simsak ngam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Philistine te pawlkhat in Jehoshaphat tungah ngunn tam mama le letsong dangte puak in, Arab te pawlkhat in tuu 7,700 le keal 7,700 puak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuabangin Jehoshaphat sia a vaanglian vaial hi. Judah ngamsung theampo ah ama in kulhte vawt in khuapite saat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />an te a vuum a saal kholna in nei hi. Ama in Jerusalem khua sungah a mindok tuam ngalkapbute sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a bee le a phung zui in koi hi. Adnah sia Judah bee le phungte sung pan ngalkapmang hi a, a khutnuai ah ngalkap 300,000 nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A zom a niina sia Jehohanan hi a, ngalkap 280,000 nei hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a zom a thumna sia Zichri tapa Amasiah hi a, ngalkap 200,000 nei hi. (Amasiah sia Topa naseam tu in ama le ama kipia hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Benjamin bee le phungte sung panin ngalkap maangpa sia a mindok tuam ngalkap Eliada hi a, lum le thal toai ngalkap 200,000 uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A zom a niina pa sia Jehozabad hi a, ngalhiam toai cinghteng pasal 180,000 uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi mite in Jerusalem ah kumpipa na a seamte hi a, tua ban ah kulh taw a ki uum Judah khuapi dangte sung zongh ah ngalkap dangte koi thua lai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat hau in a minthan ciang a innkuanpui khat le Israel kumpipa Ahab ii innkuanpui khat a kiteen natu in vaihawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kum tawmvei zawkciang Jehoshaphat sia Ahab kung haw tu in Samaria khuapi ah pai hi. Jehoshaphat le a kithol puite a patoaina in Ahab in anneakpoai atu in khui le tuu tam mama ngo hi. Ahab in Gilead ngam Ramoth khuapi a simpui tu in Jehoshaphat paa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahab in Jehoshaphat tungah, “Ramoth khua a sim khawm tu in nong kuan tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Jehoshaphat in, “Na kithoai man ciang hong son ta'n, keima le ka ngalkaphonpi a kinging sa in om khu hi. Hong pawm tu khu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, “Ahihang Topa dongh phot tawng,” ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom Ahab in kamsaangte 400 bang samin, “Kei pai in Ramoth sim tu khi ziam maw, sim ngawl tu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Amate in, “Sim in, Pathian in zawna hong pia tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang Jehoshaphat in, “ Topa ih dok thei natu in kamsaang dang om nawn ngawl ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahab in, “Khat om lai hi, Imlah ii tapa Micaiah hi. Ahihang ama ensan khi hi, banghang ziam cile ama in kei atu a pha bangma sonkhol ngeingawl hi; a pha ngawl khat veu hi tawntung hi,” ci in zo hi. Jehoshaphat in “Tuabangin ci heak in!” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, Ahab kumpipa in zum uliante khat sam a, Micaiah thakhatin hong paipui ta'n, ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipate nii sia kumpi puantualte silh a, Samaria kongpi pua sang ancilna ah kumpi tokhumte tungah a to laitakin, kamsaang theampo in amate mai ah thusuakte son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate sung pan khat, Chenaanah ii tapa Zedekiah in thik kiite vawt a, Ahab munah, “Hisia Topa ii pauna hi: ‘Hite taw Syria te na sim tu a, na zocip tu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kamsaang dang theampo in tuabang vive ma in ci uh hi. “Ramoth a sim tu kuan tavun, zo tu nu hi,” ci uh hi. Topa in zawna hong pia tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua lanin Micaiah sam tu in a pai ulian pa in, “Kamsaang dangte theampo in kumpipa zawna tu bebek son zo hi, nang zongh tuabang ma son hamtang lete pha tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang Micaiah in, “A nungta Topa min lo in ka Pathian ii son a hong sawl teng son tu khi hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama Kumpipa Ahab mai ah hong kipaipui ciang, kumpipa in, “Micaiah awng, Kumpipa Jehoshaphat le kei Ramoth ah kuanin sim tu khu ziam maw, sim ngawl tu khu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Micaiah in, “Sim vun! Na zo tu uh hi. Topa in zawna hong pia tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Ahab in, “ Topa min taw kei tungah nong pau ciangin thumaan thutak son in! Bang tanvei tuabangin hong ci tu khi ziam?” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Micaiah in, “Israel ngalkapte sia mualtung tengah tuu cing pa om ngawl a tuute kithezau bangin ka mu hi. Tuaciang Topa in, ‘Hi mite in lampui nei ngawl hi; inn ah thinnuam takin cia hen,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahab in Jehoshaphat munah, “Ama in kei huvau peuma a pha khat zongh hong sonkholsak ngeingawl hi, kong ci sa hi ka na ngawl ziam; a sia khat veu hi tawntung hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Micaiah in zomto a, “Tu in Topa pauna teng ngai vun! Topa sia vantung a kumpi tokhum tungah to a, ama ii vantunglalangte a kiim ah a ding ka mu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in, ‘Ramoth ah Ahab pai in a kithalup natu in akua in ama theam tu nu ziam?’ ci in dongh hi. Vantunglalang pawlkhat in son khat nei a, a dangte in thudang khat a son uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a khakbelin thaa khat sia mai ah hong pai a, Topa kung zuanin, ‘Keima in ama theam tu khi hi,’ a ci hi. Topa in ‘Bangbangin maw?’ ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua thaa in, ‘Keima pai in Ahab ii kamsaangte theampo leilot thu ka sonsak tu hi!’ ci in zo kik hi. Topa in, ‘Va pai ta'n a, va theam ta'n, theam zo tu ni hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang Micaiah in thu khup a, “A piang thu in hisia hi. Topa in na kamsaang hite nang tungah leilot thu hong sonsak hi. Ahihang ama mama in nang tuasiatna nga tu in a thutan sa hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciangin kamsaangpa Zedekiah in Micaiah kungah paito in, a maitang beang hi, tuaciang, “Bang hun pan kipan Topa thaa in kei hong nusia a, nang tungah hong pau ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Micaiah in, “Inn nungsang inndoi sung khat ah a buu tu in na pai ciangin mu tu ni hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Kumpipa Ahab in a uliante khat munah, “Micaiah man in a, khuapi ukpa Amon le Kumpipa tapa Joash tungah paipui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in ama thong sungah koi hen a, bangma tat ngawlin kong heak kik dong anluum le tui bek taw na vaak hen, ci in son in,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Bangma tat ngawlin nong heak kik le Topa in kei tungtawn a hong pau ngawl hi tu hi,” ci in Micaiah in ci ngaw hi. Tuaciang ama in, “Ka ci sa teng kuama po in hong ngai tavun!” ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel kumpipa Ahab le Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat te in Gilead ah Ramoth khuapi sim tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahab in Jehoshaphat munah, “Ngal kisim ciangin kei kong kimealseal tu a, nang na hile kumpi puan teng ma nong silh tu hi,” ci hi. Tuabangin Israel kumpipa kidona phual ah kimealseal in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Syria kumpipa in a siphu ngalleang ukte munah, Israel kumpipa ngawl buang a dang khat zongh sim ngawl tu nu hi ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in Kumpipa Jehoshaphat a mu uh ciangin a vekpi ma in Israel kumpipa sa ahiciang ama sim tu in kiheak uh hi. Ahihang ama hong au keak ahiciang Topa Pathian in suatak a, ama kung pan a simte kileesak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Siphu ngalleang ukte in ama sia Israel kumpipa ahi ngawl hunlam mu ahiciang amate in del nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahizong Syria ngalkapte khat ii kap thaltang khat in Kumpipa Ahab ii thikpuan kipeena pan kha luilam hi, “Kei liam khi hi! Ngalphual panin kiheam in!” ci in a siphu ngalleang hawlpa oksan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A kido saan lai tengin Kumpipa Ahab sia a siphu ngalleang sungah kikhuangkho in to a, Syria te maingat hi. Nitum laitakin ama thi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat sia Jerusalem a kumpi inn ah ciidamin heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hanani ii tapa kamsaang Jehu sia kumpipa taw kisi tu in pai a, ama tungah, “Mihing seksolte hu tu le Topa a huatsa mite panpui tu sia maan sa ni ziam? Hi bangin na ngamtatna hangin Topa thin uukna na tungah thengsak ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabang ahitazong nang sungah phatna pawlkhat om veve hi. Nangma in mite biak Asherah numeipathian milim teng na vawk siat a, Pathian ii deina zui tu na hanciam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoshaphat kumpipa sia Jerusalem khuapi ah teang hi napi a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa kungah mite sam kik tu in thangsang Beersheba pan saksang Ephraim mualtung ngammong dong a huhunin mite sungah khualhaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in kulh taw a ki uum Judah khuapi theampo ah thukhenmangte khanin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />amate hi bangin thuhil hi: “Thu na khen uh ciang kidawm vun; mihing thuneina taw ngamtat tu hi ngawl a, Topa thuneina bang hizaw hi, tuaciang thu na khen uh ciang noma taw Topa hong omkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa zakta vun a, ngamtatna kidawm vun, banghang ziam cile Topa ih Pathian in thumaan ngawl thimthelna, mi doidan kingupna le sumnguk neaknate dei ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem khua sungah Jehoshaphat in Levi mi, thiampite le khua sung lampuite pawlkhat sia Topa Thukham a paltan ciang ahibuale khua mite kihau in thu a nei uh ciang thu a khen tu in thukhenmang panmun pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in amate tungah hi bangin hil hi: “ Topa thasia vun a, na nasepna theampo ah ama thu ni in, thumaan in a muanhuai in seam tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuapite khat pawpo pan na mipuite in mihing thisakna ahizong, a dang thukham khat ahibuale thupiakna khat pawpo palsatna ahizong note kungah thu hong thetpui uh ciang amate Topa tungah a khial a maw a sua ngawl natu in thu a kisit laitakin bangbang ngamta tu ci sia pha takin hil hamtang tavun. Tuabang na seam bua uh le noma le na mipuite in Topa thin uukna na thuak tu uh hi. Ahitazong tuabang na na seam uh le mawpu ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biakna paaina taw kisai thu theampo ah Thiampi Lianbel Amariah in thu neibel tu a, Judah ngamuk mangpa Ishmael ii tapa Zebadiah sia khua mite taw kisai thu theampo ah thuneibel tu hi. Levi te in thukhenzum pan a thukhennate bangin kiseam suak ziam ci a etcik tu vaipuak nei hi. Kihansua vun a, hi hilnate bangin seam suak vun, Topa in a maanna sangah hong pang tahen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tawmvei zawkciangin Moab le Ammon ngalkaphonpite in amate pawlpui Meun te taw Judah ngam sim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kamtai pawlkhat hong pai in Jehoshaphat kumpipa tungah hi bangin ko hi: “Edom ngalkap honpui khat Tuipi Thi langkhat panin hong sim tu hong kuan hi. Amate in Hazazon Tamar khua la zo hi.” (Hi sia Engedi ii a min dang khat hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehoshaphat patau a, lam a lak natu in Topa tungah thungen hi. Tua zawkciang ama in ngamsung theampo ah an tanna khat nei natu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuapi sim pan Judah mite Topa lamlakna ngen tu in Jerusalem ah manlang tak hong pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amate le Jerusalem khua mite Biakinnpi leitual thak ah kikhawm uh hi. Jehoshaphat kumpipa hong pai in amate mai ah ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a ngingin, “Oh Topa ka taanghpupite ii Pathian awng, vantung le leitung ngam theampo na uk siat hi. Nangma sia a vaanglian a thahat na hi a, kuama in hong nalh zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma in koma Pathian na hi hi. Israel na mite hi ngam sungah hong kikhiin ciang, hi sungah a teang mite na nawtkeak a, ngam le lei teng sia na lawm Abraham suan le paal te tungah a tawntung a tu in na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate hi ngam sungah teangin nangma hong patoaina in biakinn khat sa zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />amate daan na piakna in tuasiatna khat pawpo — ngal kidona, a kilaw thei natna ahibuale kialpi — na tunsak ciang amate hong pai in nangma hong biakna hi Biakinnpi mai ah a din thei hunlam he uh hi. Amate in a ngim ngana huvau na tungah thu hong ngen thei a, tuaciang nangma in za in na suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tu in Ammon mi, Moab mi le Edom mite in ko hong sim zo hi. Ka taanghpupite Egypt ngam pan a pusua lai in tua ngamte sung a tum tu oai ngawl na hi komin ka taanghpupite in hi ngamte kiimvealin susia ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ko tungah amate hong lo kikna sia hi bang hi — nong piaksa ngam pan hong notkeak tu in amate hong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangma in koma Pathian na hi hi! Amate daan pia in. Banghang ziam cile ko hong sim, hi ngalkaphonpite mai ah ka ci ka law uh he ngawl khu hi. Bang vawt tu ci sia ka heak ngawl uh hangin nangma ii nong hu tu lam en khu hi,” ci in thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah mi theampo a zite a tate taw tualai Biakinnpi ah ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihonpi sungah a om Levi te khat ii tungah Topa thaa hong theng hi. Ama min Jahaziel hi a Zechariah ii tapa ahi hi. Ama sia Asaph bee le phung pan hi a, Mattaniah, Jeiel le Benaiah te ii sungsuak, Asaph suan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jahaziel in, “Nangma kumpipa le no Judah le Jerusalem mite theampo awng, na ngalte a tam hangin thinkiamin lau ngawl het tu nu hi, Topa in hong ci hi. Ngal kisimna sia Pathian ii sep tu hi a, no taw kisai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zing ciang amate Ziz mualciangh lam hong totto laitakin sim vun. Jeruel nai ngam tawnghtol sang paina leikuam tawpna ah na kisi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Note in hi ngal do kul ngawl tu hi. Panmunte la po vun a, ngak vun; Topa ii zawna hong piak na mu tu uh hi. Judah mite le Jerusalem mite awng, haisaang heak vun a lau heak vun. Ngalsim tu in kuan vun, Topa in note hong ompui tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Jehoshaphat kumpipa sia a mai lei pha dongin kun a, mipi teng zongh kunin Topa bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Levi te ahi Kohath le Korah ii bee le phungte dingto in a nging tatakin au a, Israel te ii Pathian, Topa pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A zing ciang zingtuungin mihonte Tekoa hui ngamsung zuan uh hi. A vaidin uh ciang Jehoshaphat in amate tungah kam vaitha hi: “Judah mite le Jerusalem mite awng! Topa na Pathian muang vun, tua hile kip takin na ding thei tu uh hi. Ama kamsaangte ii hong sonte um vun, tua hile na ma na tun tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mipite thu a kikuppui zawkciang kumpipa in music thiam pawlkhat sia biakna poai vawt ciang amate silh bul puantualte silhsak a, ngalkaphonpi mai ah paisak a: “ Topa pok vun! Ama hong itna kip tawntung hi!” ci in lasa sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuabangin lasak a kipat po uh ciang Topa in ngal a sim ngalkaphonpite tungah patauna tungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ammon te le Moab te in Edom ngalkaphonpite simin a suksiat cip zawkciang amate le amate nasia takin kisim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah ngalkaphonpi in sennealngamsung tausaang khat a thet uh ciang a ngalte sang a et le amate a vekpi in lei ah thi peakpuk sia mu uh hi. Khat zongh suakta ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jehoshaphat le a ngalkapte sia a ngalte vanh laksak tu in pai a, khui, neak le dawn, puansilhte le vanh manpha dangte mu uh hi. Amate in ni thum sung vanhte khawmtua napi tamleih ahikom a vekpi in la siat zo ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ni li ni in amate sia Beracah Kuam ah kikhawm a, ama ii vawtsa theampo atu in Topa pok uh hi. Tua ahikom tua kuam sia “Beracah” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in a ngalte zawsak zo ahikom Jehoshaphat lampui in, a ngalkapte Jerusalem ah zawna le lungdamna taw cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate khuapi a thet ciang tengtongh le lemlete tumin Biakinnpi zuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa in Israel ii ngalte a zawsakna thu a za ngam theampo lau mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuabangin Pathian in a kiim a paam pan ngammuangsak ahikom Jehoshaphat in dai takin ngam uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehoshaphat sia kum 35 a phakin Judah kumpi suak a, Jerusalem panin kum 25 sung uk hi. A nu sia Shilhi ii tanu Azubah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama mai ah a pa Asa bangma in Topa muna ah a maan in seam hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ahihang doai sepna munte susia ngawl hi. Mipite in a taanghpupite ii Pathian biakna sang ah thintak lungtak taw kiheak ngawl lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jehoshaphat ii nasep dangte theampo a kumpi maan kipat pan a bo dong Israel Kumpipate ii Taanghthu sungah a kihel Hanani ii Tapa Jehu Taanghthu sungah kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hun khat lai in Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat in thusia tam mama a vawt, Israel kumpipa Ahaziah taw kipawlna khat vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate in teambaw tawlngakna Eziongeber ah tuipi teambawte vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahihang Mareshah khua mi, Dodavahu ii tapa Eliezer in Jehoshaphat tungah, “Ahaziah taw kipawlna na vawt hu in na vawtsa nate Topa in lalsak tu hi,” ci in a kidop natu son hi. Tuaciang a teambawte siatham a, tuipi tungah paisak ngei nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoshaphat thi a, David Khuapi sung kumpi thaan ah kiphumin a tapa Jehoram in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat ii tapa Jehoram in suapui pasal luk nei a: Azariah, Jehiel, Zechariah, Azariahu, Michael le Shephatiah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa in amate khamh, ngunn le a neisa na manpha tam ma pia a, Judah ngamsung kulh taw a ki uum khuapite khat tek uksak hi. Ahihang Jehoram sia a lianbel ahikom Jehoshaphat in ama za laihsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoram in a kumpi ngamukna a kip ciang, a suapui pasalte teng le Israel uliante pawlkhat zongh thatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoram sia kum 32 a phak kumin kumpi suak a, Jerusalem khua pan kum liat sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahab ii tanute khat a teenpui hu in ama in Ahab kumpipa le Israel kumpi dangte ii seksol ngamtatna zui hi. Ama in Topa tungah mawna khialna vawt hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ahihang Topa in David taw thuciamna khat vawt zo a, David suan le paalte in ngam uk tawntung tu hi ci in kamciam ahikom Topa in David ii kumpi khangngui susia nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoram ii kumpi maan sungin Edom ngam in Judah ngam leedo in, a suakta kumpi ngam khat suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuabangin Jehoram le a ngalkap bute in siphu ngalleang taw kuanin Edom ngamsung tumin sim uh hi. Tua munah Edom te ngalkaphonpi in amate kiim uum a, ahihang zanin amate pusuak thei in suakta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua hun pan kipan Edom sia Judah khut sung pan suatakna nga hi. Jehoram in a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa a nusiat hu in hi hun sung mama in Libnah khuapi zongh in leedo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in Judah ngam mualsaangte tungah doai sepna munte ngawngawn vawtin, Judah le Jerusalem mite Topa langpanin mawna sung then hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kamsaangpa Elijah in Jehoram laithak a, a lai sungah: “Na pa Jehoshaphat kumpipa ahibuale na pu Asa kumpite ii lamlakna bangin na zui ngawl hu in na taanghpupi David ii Pathian, Topa in nang hong puavawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel kumpite lamlakna zuizaw in Ahab le ama za a laih te ii Israel te sia thumaanna panin a pialpui bangma Judah le Jerusalem mite Pathian tungah thumaan ngawl tu in lam na pui hi. Nangma sangin mi phazaw na suapuite ngawngawn na suamlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa in na mite, na tate le na zite nasia takin daan pia tu a, na neisate susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangma mama in ngilzang natna khat na nga tu a, ni khat sangin ni khat nasia vaial tu hi,” ci in at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Philistine te le Arab te pawlkhat sia Ethiopia te pawlkhat teenna tuipi dung teng ah teang uh hi. Tua mite sia Jehoram a sim tu in Topa in thawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in Judah ngam simin kumpipa inn phuul a, a tapa nobel Ahaziah simngawl a zite le a tapate theampo paipui in thongtaaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiteng theampo a pian zawkciang Topa in kumpipa sia a bot mama ngilsung natna khat veisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A natna nasia vaial in kum nii dektak zawkciang thuak zo ngawlin thi hi. A khutnuai ngammite ii a taanghpupite atu a vawtsak ngei bangin thina huvau khuangaina lakna in meimang sep ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jehoram kum 32 a phak ciang kumpi suak a, Jerusalem khua pan kum liat sung uk hi. A thi ciang kuama khuangai ngawl hi. Amate in ama sia David Khuapi sungah phum ahihang kumpi thaan ah phum ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Arab te pawlkhat in Jerusalem simin Jehoram kumpipa ii tapa teng a nobel Ahaziah simngawl thatlum siat hi. Tua ahikom tu in Jerusalem khua mite in Ahaziah sia a pa ii kumpiza laihsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaziah kum 22 a phakin kumpi suak a, Jerusalem khua pan kum khat sung uk hi. A nu Athaliah — Israel kumpipa Omri ii tunu, Ahab kumpipa ii tanu — ii ngaisutna a piak hu in ama a tatsia suaksak a Ahaziah zongh Ahab kumpipa innkuan ii ngamtatna zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pa thi zawkciang Ahab kumpipa innkuanpui dang teng sia ama ngaisutna a piate suak ahi hu in Topa tungah maw in tuate in ama puksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate ii ngaisutna piak bangin ama in zui a Syria kumpipa Hazael taw ngal kidona ah Israel kumpipa Joram pawlpui hi. Gilead ngam Ramoth ah ngalkaphonpite kisim a, ngalsimna ah Joram liam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A liamna kibawl tu in Joram sia Jezreel khuapi ah heak kik a, tua munah Ahaziah in ve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi bangin Joram a ve in a pai sia Pathian in Ahaziah ii puk natu in a zak ahi hi. Tua mun ah Ahaziah a taam sungin Ahab kumpi khang ngui siasak tu in Topa ii tealsa Nimshi ii tapa Jehu in ama le Joram thato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian ii tua khangngui tungah a thukhen bang Jehu in a taksuasak laitakin Ahaziah khualhawna ah a zui Ahaziah ii tute le Judah lampuite pawlkhat taw kisii uh hi. Jehu in amate that siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahaziah a kizon ciang a bukna Samaria khua sungah mu hi. Amate in ama sia Jehu kungah paipui in thatsak hi. Ahihang amate in Topa atu a sep thei za a seam a pu Jehoshaphat kumpipa a zatakna uh taw Ahaziah ii luang sia phum hi. Ahaziah innkuan sungah kumpi ngam uk thei tu khat zongh taang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahaziah kumpipa ii nu Athaliah in a tapa a kithalupsak sia a heak po ciang Judah kumpi innkuanpui theampo a kithalup natu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahaziah in thiampi Jehoiada taw a kiteang Jehosheba a kici suapui sealh numei khat nei hi. Tua nu in Ahaziah ii tapate khat a hi Joash a kici pa suatak ku in, a kithat tu kumpi tapa dangte kung panin la a, nau omh khat taw Biakinnpi sung lupna inndoi khat sungah phual hi. Tuabangin a seal hu in Jehosheba in Joash sia Athaliah khut sungah a thi natu panin suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Athaliah ii kumpinu a sep kum luk sung theampo tua munah ama buu top hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum luk sung a ngak zawkciang thiampi Jehoiada in a sep tu hun hong theng zo hi ci in khensat hi. Ama in ngalkapbu ngate: Jeroham ii tapa Azariah, Jehohanan ii tapa Ishmael, Obed ii tapa Azariah, Adaiah ii tapa Maaseiah le Zichri ii tapa Elishaphat te taw thukimna khat vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate Judah khuapi theampo ah khualhaw in Levi te le, bee le phung lutangte a vekpi in Jerusalem ah paipui kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate a vekpi in Biakinnpi sungah kikhawmtua in kumpipa ii tapa Joash taw thuciamna khat vawt uh hi. Jehoiada in amate tungah, “Hong thi san sa kumpipa ii a tapa sia hi lai ah om hi! David suan le paalte kumpi seam tu hi ci a, Topa ii kamciamsa thu om bangin ama zongh tu in kumpi suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ih vawt tu sia hisia hi. Thiampite le Levi te, Sabbath ni in vaipuak nei tu in hong pai uh ciangin khen thum sua khen khat in biakinn kongpite cing tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a dang khen thum sua khen khat in kumpi inn cing tu hi, a taanglai teng in Kongpi Bulpi ah om tu uh hi. Mite theampo biakinn leitual ah kikhawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A vaipuak a seam thiampite le Levi te simngawl kuama biakna innte sungah tumsak ngawl hi. Amate sia a ki aap sate ahikom tum thei hi, a dangte ahile Topa thupiak bang peal ngawlin zui in, a pua sangah a om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levi te in namsau doksa in kumpipa cingin, a paina pawpo ah om tu uh hi. Biakinnpi sung tum a sawm pawpo sia kithatlum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levi te le Judah mipite in Jehoiada thupiak bangin seam suak uh hi. Sabbath ni in vaipuak a pengte ciasak ngawl ahikom nasep ukte in naseam tu hong kuante le nasep a mansa a cia tute zongh na seamsak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoiada in Biakinnpi sungah a kep David kumpipa ii neisa lumte le teite uliante pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in kumpipa cing tu in pasalte namsau dok sa in Biakinnpi mai kiimkot ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jehoiada in Joash pusuapui a, kumpilukhu khusakin kumpi ki ukna thukham laibu khat pia hi. Tuabangin ama kumpi kisuaksak hi. Thiampi Jehoaiada le a tapate in Joash sathau noai a, a om theampo in, “Kumpipa a khansau tahen,” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihonpite ii kumpipa a pokna aw Athaliah in a zaak ciang mihon kikhopna Biakinnpi ah manlang takin pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in tua munah kumpi thak pa zongh kumpipa atu in a kituam koi Khuam sia kung, biakinn tumna ah ngalkap bute le lemle tumte in kiim uum in a ding mu hi. A om theampo lungdamin au a lemle tum hi, biakinn music thiamte in tumtheite taw tua poai lampui uh hi. Athaliah khuangai a, a puante baltham in “Hong leeheak hi! Hong leeheak hi!” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jehoiada in Athaliah sia biakinn huang sungah a kithalup tu dei ngawl ahikom a ngalkap bute pawlkhat sam a, “Ama la in, a ngualin a om a cingte kilaklaw panin paipui vun, ama suatak tu a sawm pawpo that vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in ama zamh in kumpi inn ah paipui a tua mun Siphu Kongpi ah thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thiampi Jehoiada in Joash kumpipa le mipite ama taw kingawm in Topa mi ahi natu in thuciamna khat vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate Baal biakinn ah pai siatin biakinn susia hi. Amate in tua munah biaknataute le milimte saattham siatin biaknatau mai ah Baal thiampi Mattan thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehoiada in thiampite le Levi te Biakinnpi ah nasep a uk tu in koi hi. Amate in David kumpipa ii a see sa nasep om bangin a sep suak tu le Moses Thukham om bangin Topa tungah a kipia sangaw biakpiaknate a hal tu ahi hi. Amate in tumthei te le poai vawtna te zongh uk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jehoiada in biakpiakna ah a thiang ngawlte peuma a khaam tu in biakinn kongcingte zongh koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngalkap bute, khua mi lampuite, ulian te le mipite theampo in Jehoiada pawm a, a kingual sa in Biakinnpi pan kumpi inn ah kumpipa paipui uh hi. Amate kongpi lianbel panin tumin tuaciang kumpi tokhum tungah kumpipa hong to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu in Athaliah kithatlum zo ahikom khuapi thimdide in mi theampo lungdamna taw kidim uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joash sia kum sali a phak kumin Judah kumpi suak a, Jerusalem pan kum 40 sung uk hi. A nu sia Beersheba khua mi Zibiah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in thiampi Jehoiada nuntak laitengin a sep a vawtna ah Topa lungdamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehoiada in Joash kumpipa atu in zi nii tealsak a, a zite taw tanute tapate toai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tawmvei kumpi a sep zawkciang Joash in Biakinnpi puuaphat tu in khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in thiampite le Levi te Judah ngamsung khuapi theampo ah paisak in kum sim Biakinnpi puua natu a kisam za sum khon tu in sawl hi. Ama in manlang a vawt paih natu in sawl ahihang Levi te haisaang ahiciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama in amate lampui Jehoiada samin, “ Topa ompuina Puanbuk atu in mipite in panpuina phiangshia pia tahen ci a Topa naseampa Moses ii tangkal bangin, banghangin Levi te in Judah mite le Jerusalem mite tung pan shia khonsak ngawl ni ziam?” ci in thu dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />(Nupi thimthel Athaliah ii nungzuite in Biakinnpi susia in biakinn vanh thiangtho tam mamate Baal biakna in zangh zo hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa in Levi te tungah sum khiakte khol natu thingkuang khat vawtin biakinn kongpi ah a koi natu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in Pathian naseampa Moses ii a masabel in duisung ngampa ah a khon phiangshia sia kuama po in Topa tungah a piak natu in Jerusalem le Judah ngamsung theampo ah zasak kawkoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi thu in mipite le a lampuite lungdamsak a, amate in a shia sumte hong paipui tekin thingkuang dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni simin Levi te in tua vaipuak nei kumpi ulian khat tungah tua thingkuang puak uh hi. Thingkuang a dim simin kumpi thuzeakpa le Thiampi Lianpa ii taangmipa in a sumte la in a thingkuang sia a omna ngei ah koi kik uh hi. Tuabangin amate in sum tam ma khon uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa le Jehoiada in tua sumte sia Biakinnpi puuana a saite tungah pia uh hi, amate in a puua tu in suang ciangte, lettamate le thik vawt te cial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Naseamte theampo in nasep hanciam tekin Biakinnpi sia a sakciil bang linlian in a kho mama in puuapha kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A puuanate a man zawkciang khamh le ngunn a taanglaite sia kumpipa le Jehoiada pia a, amate in Biakinnpi atu a kisamh kuangnote le nazak dangte vawtna in zangh uh hi. Jehoiada nuntak lai tengin Biakinnpi ah sangaw biakpiakna te a hun maan in kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai mama in kum 130 a phak zawkciang ama thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mipi atu, Pathian atu le Biakinnpi atu a nasep kiheaksak na in amate in David Khuapi, kumpi thaan ah phum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang Jehoiada thi zawk po ciang Judah lampuite in Joash kumpipa sia amate thu ngai tu in zol zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom, mipite in a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa Biakinnpi sungah biakna vawt nawn ngawlin milimte le Asherah numeipathian limte bia tu kipan uh hi. Hi mawna khialna a vawt nate taw Judah le Jerusalem tungah Topa thin uuksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in ama a zot kik natu a phawksak tu in amate kungah kamsaangte a puak hang mite in nangai ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Pathian thaa in thiampi Jehoiada ii tapa Zechariah tungah theng hi. Ama mipite mu theina ah dingin, “ Topa Pathian in banghangin a thupiakte zui ngawlin noma le noma tungah tuasiatna tungsak nu ziam! Note in ama nusia nu hi, tua hu in ama in note hong nusia hi!” ci in aukeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joash kumpipa in Zechariah a kithasawmna ah pawmin, kumpipa thupiakna taw mipite in biakinn tual ah Zechariah suang taw deanglum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa in Zechariah ii pa Jehoiada ii ama tungah a thumaan nasepnate mangil a, Zechariah thatsak hi. Zechariah in a thi dektak ciang, “Na vawt uh sia Topa in hong mu in note daan hong pia tahen!” ci in au san hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua kum tangngam phalbi kipat hun ciang Syria ngalkaphonpi in Judah le Jerusalem simin a lampui theampo that a, vanh tam mama laksak in Damascus ah ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Syria ngalkapte tawm ahihang, Judah mite in a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa a taisat hu in Topa in a tamzaw pek Judah ngalkaphonpite zosak hi. Hi bangin Joash kumpipa daan kithuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama nasia takin liam a, ngalte a nungkin zawkciang thiampi Jehoiada ii tapa a thalup hu in a ulian te nii in thasawm a, a phulamna in a lupna tungah thatlum hi. Ama David Khuapi sungah kiphum ahihang kumpi thaan ah kiphum ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />(Joash a suamte sia Ammon numei Shimeath ii tapa Zabad le Moab numei Shimrith ii tapa Jehozabad ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpite ii Thubu Sontelna sungah Joash tapate taanghthu, ama atu a pha ngawl kamsaanna te le Biakinnpi a sak kikna thu tepteenate kihel hi. A tapa Amaziah in a kumpiza laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amaziah sia kum 25 a phakin kumpi suak a, Jerusalem pan kum 29 sung uk hi. A nu sia Jerusalem khua mi Jehoaddin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Topa diksak bang seam ahihang a sepna ah thalawp ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama thuneina a kip po ciang, a pa a that ulian teng that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang ama in Moses Thukham sungah Topa thupiak bang zui in tua ulian te ii tate that ngawl hi, Moses Thukham sungah: “A tate ii khialna liante hangin a nu le a pa kithat ngawl tu a, a nu le a pa khialna liante hangin a tate kithat ngawl tu hi; mihing khat sia ama mama ii vawt khialna lian hang bekin kithisak tu hi,” ci in om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaziah kumpipa in Judah le Benjamin namte sung pan pasal theampo ngalkap tumsak a, a bee a phung zui in khen hi, tuaciang tulkhat uk le zakhat uk tu in ngalkapbute koi hi. Hi sungah kum kul le a tungsia theampo kihel a, a vekpi in 300,000 pha hi. Amate sia ngalkap a khop tuamte hi a, ngalsim thei paih tu lum le tei toai thiam sa te vive hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua bek dom ngawlin ama in ngunn kilogramme 3,400 bang thaman pia in, Israel ngalkap 100,000 cial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang kamsaang khat kumpipa kungah pai in, “Hi Israel ngalkapte la heak in. Hi saksang kumpi ngam pan mite Topa in ompui ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in ngal kisimna ah nang hong thahatsak zaw tu hi, ci in um tha tu ni hi, ahihang zawna le lelna a pia vaang a nei sia Pathian hi a, ama in na ngalte hong lelsak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaziah kumpipa in kamsaangpa tungah, “Tua ahile ka piaksa ngunnte theampo a thawthong suak tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Kamsaangpa in, “Tuasia sangin a tamzaw Topa in nang hong pia kik thei hi!” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Amaziah in a cial ngalkapte ciasak kik hi. Tuabangin amate cia a, Judah mite tungah thin uuk mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaziah ama le ama kihansua in Ci Kuam ah a ngalkaphonpi paipui hi. Tua munah amate in Edom ngalkapte simin 10,000 thatin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a dang 10,000 man uh hi. Amate in thongtaakte Sela khuapi liangbo sia tungah paipui a, a nuai suang tungah a kiseplum tu in lawnsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Amaziah ii a ngalsim khoppui tu in a oai ngawl Israel ngalkapte in Samaria le Beth Horon kilaklaw a om Judah khuapite sim a, pasal 3,000 thatin, vanh tam mama laaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaziah sia Edom ngalkapte zo in a cia kik ciang, amate ii biak milimte ciapui a, omna pia a, tuaciang ngimnamtui halin bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hisia in Topa thin uuksak ahiciang, Amaziah kungah kamsaang khat paisak hi. Kamsaangpa in, “Nangma khut sung pan ngawngawn in a mipuite a hun zo ngawl ngamdang pathiante banghangin bia ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kampau suan a, Amaziah in, “Bang hun pan kipanin kumpipa ngaisutna pia tu in hong koi khu ziam? Pau nawn heak in, tua ahibuale hong thatsak tu khi hi!” ci hi. Kamsaangpa in, “Hi bang teng ngamta zo a, ngaisutna kong piak sia awlmawk ngawl na hi hu in Pathian in nangma hong susia tu in khensat zo ahi sia tu in ka he hi,” a ci zawkciang a pau tawp pheang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Amaziah le ama thu dokte in Israel ngam sim sawm uh hi. Tuaciang ama in Jehoahaz ii tapa, Jehu ii tupa Israel kumpipa Jehoash tungah thu puakin a do natu in thato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehoash in Amaziah tungah hi bangin zo kik hi: “Khatvei lai in Lebanon Mualte tung pan lingkung khat in cedar thing kung tungah thu khat puak hi: ‘Ka tapa zi tu in na tanu hong pia ta'n,’ ci hi. Ngamsa khat pai in tua lingkung siikcil hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu in Amaziah awng Edom te na zaw hu in kiphasak ni hi, ahihang na inn ah om hithiat lete hong oai zaw khi hi. Banghangin nangma le na mite tuasiat natu bekin ngim zong vealvul ni ziam?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang Amaziah in tua thu nadon ngawl hi. Hi bang a Amaziah ii a ngallel tu sia Pathian ii deina hi a, ama ii Edom milimte a biak hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabangin Israel kumpipa Jehoash in Judah kumpipa Amaziah sim tu in kuan hi. Amate Judah ngam Beth Shemesh ah kisii a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judah ngalkaphonpite ngallel in, a inn tek ah tai siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehoash in Amaziah manin Jerusalem ah paipui hi. Tua munah ama in khuapi uumna luphung sia Ephraim Kongpi panin Khuakiing Kongpi ciang metre 200 dektak a sau sia sutham uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in Biakinnpi sung pan a laaksak ngunn le khamh te theampo, Obed Edom ii suan le paalte ii a cin biakinn vanhzakte le kumpi inn sungah a om sum le vanh manpha theampo Samaria ah paipui kik hi. A ngalmatte zongh tonpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Amaziah sia Israel kumpipa Jehoash sangin kum sawm le kum nga a khansauzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaziah ii kumpi maanna a kipat pan a bo dong a vawt dangte theampo Judah le Israel Kumpite Taanghthu sungah kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amaziah ii Topa a leedo hun pan kipan Jerusalem khua ah ama kithasawm hi. A khakbel ciang ama sia Lachish khuapi ah tai ahihang, a ngalte in zui in tua munah that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A luang sia Jerusalem ah siphu taw kipua in, David Khuapi sung kumpite thaan ah kiphum hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah mite theampo in Amaziah ii tapa kum sawm le kum luk a pha Uzziah sia a pa ii kumpiza laih tu in teal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Amaziah ii thi zawkciang Uzziah in Elath khuapi la kikin puua kik hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzziah sia kum sawm le kum luk a phakin kumpi suak a, ama in Jerusalem khua pan kum 52 sung uk hi. A nu sia Jerusalem khua mi Jecoliah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pa ngamtat zui in, Topa ii diksak te seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Biakna vai a thudok Zechariah ii nuntak lai teng Uzziah in thumaan takin Topa na seam ahikom Pathian in ama thupha pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uzziah in Philistine te taw kisim hi. Ama in Gath, Jamnia le Ashdod khuapite uumna luphungte sutham in Ashdod nai le Philistia ngam mun dangte ah kulh taw a ki uum khuapite saat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in Philistine te, Gurbaal ah a teang Arab te le Meun te Uzziah ii a zaw natu in hu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ammon te in Uzziah tungah phiangshia pia a, ama vaanglian ahikom a minthanna sia Egypt ngam dong ngawngawn ah kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uzziah in Khuakiing Kongpi, Kuam Kongpi le luphung kiheakna king teng ah ngal vilna tausaangte a sakna taw in Jerusalem uumna kulh sia khosak vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in ngam taanzauna zongh ah kulh taw a ki uum tausaangte sa hi, nganno tam mama nei ahikom nitumna sang mualpeang le zaangtamte ah tuikhuk tam ma to hi. Ama in lothaw nasep kin ahikom, mualtung ngamte le lei phana theampo tho in sapithuan vawt tu in mite hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in ngalsim thei paih tu ngalkap honpui khat nei hi. A thu tepteena teng kumpi zum naseam khat ahi Hananiah khutnuai ah a thuzeakpi ahi Jeiel le Maaseiah in len uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ngalkaphonpi sia ngalkapbu 2,600 in uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate khutnuai ah kumpipa atu ngalte a sim zo takpi tu ngalkap thiam 307,500 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Uzziah in a ngalkaphonpite sia lum, tei, thik lukhu, thikpuan, thal le thaltangte, le saili suangtangte pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem khua ngal vilna tausaangte le khuapi luphung kingte tung pan thal kaap natu le suang liante lot natu in a kisamh na teng ngalhiam vawt thiamte in vawt uh hi. Pathian ii ompui hu in Uzziah sia thahat mama a, mun theampo ah minthang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang Uzziah kumpipa a tha a hat ciang a kisakthei vaial na in ama puksak hi. Ama in ngimnamtui halna biaknatau tungah ngimnamtui hal tu in Biakinnpi sungah a tumna taw Topa a Pathian melsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thiampi Azariah le, a hat le a hang thiampi 80 te in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kumpipa nalh tu in a nung pan zui uh hi. Amate in, “Uzziah awng! Topa tungah ngimnamtui hal tu sia nang sep tu hi ngawl hi. Aaron suan thiampite bek sia hi na seam tu in ki aaptuam hi. Hi mun thiangtho nusia in. Topa Pathian tungah khial zo na hikom ama thupha na saang nawn bua hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uzziah sia Biakinnpi sung ngimnamtui biaknatau kungah ngimnamtui halna khat toai in ding hi. Thiampite tungah thin uuk ahikom thakhat thu in ama ii talki tungah a kiitakhuai vun natna khat theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azariah le thiampi dangte lau in kumpipa talki salh a, Biakinnpi sung pan hawlkhia uh hi. Ama sia Topa in daan pia zo ahikom manlang takin pusuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Uzziah kumpipa sia tua hun pan a nuntak lai teng theampo a natna hu in biakna taw kisai in thiangtho nawn ngawl hi. Biakinnpi sungah tum thei nawn ngawlin ama inn bek ah teangin, a nasep theampo pan kitongsak hi, tuaciang a tapa Jotham in ngam uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uzziah kumpipa ii kumpi maan sung, a nasep dang theampo sia Amoz tapa, kamsaang Isaiah in ciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Uzziah thi a, kumpi thaan huang sungah kiphum ahihang a natna hu in kumpi thaankuul sungah kiphum ngawl hi. A tapa Jotham in a kumpiza laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jotham sia kum 25 a phakin kumpi suak a, Jerusalem pan kum sawm le kum luk sung uk hi. A nu sia Zadok ii tanu Jerushah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a pa ngamtat bangin, Topa ii dik a sak te seam hi; ahihang a pa bang hi ngawlin Biakinnpi sungah ngimnamtui halin maw ngawl hi. A mite ahile mawna vawt veve uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Biakinnpi Saksang Kongpi a vawtpa le Jerusalem khua huam sung Ophel a kicina munah khuapi uumna luphung nasia tak a vawtpa sia Jotham ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Judah mualtung teng ah khuapite saatin dui sungah kulhte le tausaangte sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Ammon kumpipa le a ngalkaphonpi simin zo hi. Tua zawkciang ama tungah zawthawk thu taw Ammon mite in phiangshia te kum simin kum thum sung a nuai a bangin piasak a: ngunn kilogramme 3,400, zungtaang tann 1,000 le mangtaang tann 1,000 ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thutakna taw Topa a Pathian thu a nit hu in Jotham thahat vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jotham ii kumpi maan sung thupiang dang teng, a ngal simnate le a paizia thute sia Israel le Judah Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kiciamtee siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jotham sia kum 25 a phak kumin kumpi suak a, Jerusalem pan kum sawm le kum luk sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama thi in, David Khuapi sungah kiphum a, tuaciang a tapa Ahaz in a kumpiza laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaz sia kum kul a phakin kumpi suak a, Jerusalem pan kum sawm le kum luk sung uk hi. Ama in a taanghpupi David kumpipa ii ngamtatna phate zui ngawl a, Topa diksak ngawlte vawtin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel kumpite ngamtatna zui zaw hi. Ama in thik taw Baal milimte vawtsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinnom Kuam ah ngimnamtui halin, Israel mite maisang a manaw hun lai a, Topa ii a ngamsung pan a nawkeak mite ii a zak a kiihuai nasepte zui in a tapate ngawngawn meihal biakpiakna in milimte pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Doai biakna mun mualtung le thinglim nuai theampo ah Ahaz in sangaw biakpiaknate nei in ngimnamtui hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahaz kumpipa mawna hangin Topa a Pathian in ama Syria kumpipa in zosak a, Judah mi tam mama manin Damascus ah thongtaak tu in paipui hi. Topa in Ahaz sia Remaliah ii tapa Israel kumpipa Pekah zongh in zosak a, ni khat thu in Judah ngalkap ngalhangbel 120,000 thatsak hi. Judah mite in a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa a nusiat hu in hi bangin piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel ngalkap Zichri a kici pa in Ahaz kumpipa ii tapa Maaseiah, kumpi inn uk Azrikam le kumpipa dom a thunei Elkanah that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah mite sia amate ii mipui hi napi Israel ngalkapte in numei le patang 200,000 thongtaak tu in man a, a laaksak vanh tam mama te taw Samaria ah heakpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Oded kici Topa kamsaang pa khat sia Samaria khuapi ah teang hi. Ama zongh ngalsimna pan Judah mi thongtaakte taw hong heak kik Israel ngalkaphonpi khuapi sungah a tum dektakte taw kisi a, ama in, “Judah te tungah na taanghpupite Topa Pathian a thin uuk hu in amate hong zosak hi, ahihang tu in tatsia in amate tam lei na thalup uh sia ama in za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu in Jerusalem le Judah ngam panin numei pasalte noma sila na suaksak nuam uh hi. Topa na Pathian tungah zongh mawna khialna na vawt uh hunlam kihe ngawl nu ziam?.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hong ngai tavun! Hi thongtaakte sia na suapuinumeite le na suapui pasalte veu hi. Tha kik siat vun, tua ahibuale Topa a thin uuk in note daan hong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saksang kumpi ngam pan a lampui pasal li ahi Jehohanan ii tapa Azariah, Meshillemoth ii tapa Berechiah, Shallum ii tapa Jehizkiah le Hadlai ii tapa Amasa te zongh in ngalkapte ngamtatna nalh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in, “Tua thongtaakte hi sungah hong paipui heak vun! Topa tungah ih maw zo a, daan hong piak khom natu in a thin ih uuksak zo hi. Tu in ih mawna a khan seseam natu khat sep na sawm uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuasia ciang ngalkaphonpi in thongtaakte le a laaksak vanhte sia mipite le a lampuite tungah a aap tu le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuate sung pan puansilhte a thongtaak teng tungah a hawmsak tu in tua mi lite panmun kipia hi. Amate in a silh tu in puante, a thua tu peangdapte le an le tui a khom tu pia in a liammate olive thau noisak hi. Thazawmin lampai zo ngawlte laa tungah tosakin a mat thongtaakte theampo Judah ngam Palm thingkung khuapi a kici Jericho ah kipaipui kik hi. Tua zawkciang Israel mite Samaria ah cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Edom te in Judah ngam sim kik in, thongtaak tu tam mama man hi, tua ahikom Ahaz kumpipa in Assyria kumpilianpa Tiglath Pileser tungah hu ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua laitak ma in Philistine mite in nitumna sang mualpeang le Judah thangsang a om khuate sim hi. Amate in Beth Shemesh, Aijalon le Gederoth khuapite a laak zawkciang Soco, Timnah le Gimzo khuapite le a kiim ah khuanote la a, tua munah teang suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Ahaz in a mite ii a nga tuakte pheltan a, Topa ii thu nial ahikom Judah ngam ah Topa in ngimnate tungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa in Ahaz kumpipa hu ngawl bek dom ngawlin langpanin thinngimna piazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Ahaz in Biakinnpi, kumpi inn le mipi lampuite inn panin khamh teng la a, tua kumpilianpa pia hi, ahitazong hu nuam tuan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahaz sia a thinngimbel hun hong thet ciang Topa tungah nidang sangin zongh maw zaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in ama a zo Syria mite ii pathiante tungah sangaw biakpiakna pia hi. Ama in, “Syria pathiante ii Syria kumpite a hu bangma in, tua sangaw biakpiaknate pia lei leng kei zongh hong hu tu hi,” ci hi. Tuasia hu in ama le a mite tungah tuasiatna tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua dom ngawlin ama in, biakinn sung vanhzak theampo la in sutham siat hi. Ama in Topa Biakinnpi khakbil in Jerusalem khua sungah biaknatau sa kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judah ngam khuapite le khua lian theampo ah ama in ngamdang pathiante tungah ngimnamtui hal natu in doai sepna mun vawt kawkoai hi. Tubangin ama in a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa thin uukna ama tung ma ah thengsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A kumpi maan hun sungin a dang thupiangte theampo sia a kipat pan a tawp dongin Judah te le Israel Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaz thi a, Jerusalem khua sungah kiphum ahihang kumpite thaan sungah kiphum ngawl hi. A tapa Hezekiah in a kumpiza laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekiah sia kum 25 a phak kumin kumpi suak a, Jerusalem khua pan kum 29 sung uk hi. A nu sia Zechariah ii tanu Abijah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a taanghpupi David kumpipa ngamtatna zui in, Topa diksak nate seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hezekiah ii kumpi a sua kum a tha khat tha in ama in Biakinnpi kongpite hong kik in puuasak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Biakinnpi nisuana sang leitual ah thiampite le Levi te pawlkhat khawmtua in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />thu son hi. Ama in “Levi te awng noma le noma a thiang tak ki aap vun a, na taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa Biakinnpi thiangthosak vun. Biakinnpi a ninsak te theampo Biakinnpi pan heam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ih taanghpupite in Topa ih Pathian tungah thumaan ngawl a, Topa diksak ngawlte vawt uh hi. Amate in Topa nusia in ama teenna mun nungngat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in Biakinnpi kongkhate khakbil a, meivakte mitsak in, Israel te ii Pathian ii Biakinnpi sungah ngimnamtui hal nawn ngawlin; meihai biakpiaknate vawt nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hu in Judah le Jerusalem tungah Topa thin uuk mama a, amate tungah a vawt thute in a kuama po ingh in lausak hi. Tua thu na he tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ih pate ngal sungah kithat in, ih zite le ih tate sia thongtaak tu in kipaipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Hi bang teng ahikom ei tungah Topa Israel te ii Pathian sia a thin a uuk nawn ngawl natu in ama taw tu in thuciamna khat vawt tu in ka khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tapate awng, hun bothongsak heak vun. Note sia ama atu ngimnamtui hal tu le ama biakna ah mipite lampui tu in, Topa tealsa mite na hi uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nuai a Levi te sia tua munah om hi: Kohath bee le phung pan Amasai ii tapa Mahath le Azariah ii tapa Joel Merari bee le phung pan Abdi ii tapa Kish le Jehallelel ii tapa Azariah Gershon bee le phung pan Zimnah ii tapa Joah le Joah ii tapa Eden Elizaphan bee le phung pan Shimri le Jeuel Asaph bee le phung pan Zechariah le Mattaniah Heman bee le phung pan Jehuel le Shimei Jeduthun bee le phung pan Shemaiah le Uzziel
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi mite in Levi mipuite khawmtua in amate le amate a zeksa om bang kithiangsak siat uh hi. Tua zawkciang kumpipa thupiak bangin Topa Thukham zui in a zeksa om bangin Biakinnpi thiansua tu kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Biakinnpi thiansua tu in a sungah thiampite tumin a zeksa taw kisai in a thiangtho ngawl vanh theampo biakinn leitual ah pusua uh hi. Tua mun panin Levi te in tua vanhte la a, khuapi pua sang Kidron Kuam ah tua siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate nasep sia tha masabel, a ni masabel ni in kipan a, ni liat ni in, biakinn sung tumna inndoi zongh kihel in zo siat hi. Tua zawkciang amate in a dang ni liat sung ma seam a, tua tha ni sawm le ni luk ni in biakna vawt natu in Biakinnpi puuakhol uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Levi te in Hezekiah kumpipa tungah a nuai a bangin thu zaaksakna nei hi: “Biakinnpi buppi, meihal biakpiak natu in biaknatau anluum thiangtho koina sabuai le vanhzakte theampo a zeksa om bangin ka thiansua siat zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahaz kumpipa ii Topa tungah a thumaan ngawl hun sungin a laak vanhzakte theampo zongh paipui kikin, Pathian tungah ka aap kik zo uh hi. Tuate theampo Topa ii biaknatau mai ah om hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hezekiah kumpipa in haisaang ngawlin khua sung lampuite kaikhawm a, Biakinnpi ah paikhawm tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in kumpi bangkua le Judah mite mawphel biakpiak natu le Biakinnpi thiansua natu in khuital sali, tuu sali, tuuno sali le keal sali paipui uh hi. Kumpipa in tua ngannote biaknatau tungah sangaw biakpiakna in piak tu in Aaron suan le paal thiampite sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thiampite in a masabel in khuitalte ngo a, tua zawkciang tuute le tuunote ngoin khat sim ii chi veu biaknatau tungah the uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A khakbelin amate in kealte, kumpipa le biakna a vawt dangte kungah paipui in tua kealte tungah a khut uh nga tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel mite theampo atu in meihal biakpiakna le mawphel biakpiakna a vawt tu in kumpipa in thupia ahikom thiampite in kealte ngo a, a chi sia mipite theampo mawmai natu in biaknatau tungah sung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in David kumpipa atu in a kamsaangpa Gad le kamsaang Nathan tungtawnin a piak hilnate kumpipa in zui hi; ama in Levi te Biakinnpi sungah tengtongh le daalkopsai te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David kumpipa ii zaksa tumtheite taw panmun lasak hi. Thiampite zongh lemle taw tualai ah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Meihal biakpiaknate piak natu in Hezekiah in thupia a; biakpiakna a kipat ciang mipite in Topa pokna lasa in music thiam te in lemle le tumthei dang theampo tum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua munah a om mi theampo in biakna vawt khawmin lasakna le a dang tumtheite zongh sangaw biakpiaknate a kihal siat dong kizom suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Hezekiah kumpipa le mipite theampo khupdin in Pathian bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kumpipa le ngam lampuite in David le kamsaang Asaph ii a phua pokna late Topa tungah a sak natu in Levi te sawl uh hi. A sawl bangma in a kuama po in lungdamna lianpi taw khupdin in lasa a, Pathian bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hezekiah in mipite tungah, “Tu in note a zeksa om bangin thiang zo na hi uh ciang Topa tungah lungdamko biakpiakna in sangaw biakpiakna hong paipui tavun,” ci hi. Amate zongh thuni in vawt a, pawlkhatte in meihal biakpiak natu in amate thu in nganno ngaw tute paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate in Topa tungah meihal biakpiak natu in khuital 70, tuu 100 le tuuno 200 paipui uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />amate in mipite neak tu in sangaw biakpiakna in khuital 600 le tuu 3,000 zongh paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nganno hiza a ngo tu in thiampite kicing zo ngawl ahikom Levi te in nasep a man dong hu uh hi. Tuasia hunin thiampite a tamzaw a zeksa om bangin kithiangsak zo hi. (A zeksa kithiansakna thu ah thiampite sangin Levi te thumaan zaw uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pum bup hal sangaw biakpiakna ah a piak banah mipite neak tu in sangaw biakpiakna pan ngan ii thaute a hal tu le meihal biakpiakna taw a kipia sapittui a sung tu sia thiampite ii nasep ahi hi. Tuabangin Biakinnpi ah biakna vawt kipan kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathian huna taw hi nasep theampo manlang takin zo ahikom Hezekiah kumpipa le mipite lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A zeksa ngeina om bangin a kithiansua sa thiampite a kicing khom om ngawl a, mipite zongh Jerusalem khua ah tam kikhawmtua ngawl ahikom mite ii Paisan Poai sia a tha masa sung a vawt ngei hunin vawt thei ngawl uh hi. Tua ahikom Hezekiah kumpipa, a uliante le Jerusalem mite in a tha niina tha sungin Paisan Poai vawt tu thukim uh hi, kumpipa in Israel le Judah mite theampo tungah tua thu kam vaitha hi. Israel te ii Pathian, Topa patoai natu in Jerusalem Biakinnpi ah Paisan Poai hong siim natu in Hezekiah kumpipa in Ephraim le Manasseh namte atu kin vawt tuanin sapna lai thaak tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa le mite in amate ngealna uh diksa hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tua ahi bangma, amate in saksang pan Dan, thangsang pan Beersheba dong a om, Israel mite theampo a pai ngei za sangin a tamzaw pek Jerusalem ah a pai tek natu Thukham om bangin Paisan Poai vawt tu in sam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa le a uliante ii thu piakna om bangin Judah ngam le Israel ngamsung theampo ah kamtaite paisak kawkoai in hi bangin samsak hi: “Israel mite awng, Assyria te ii hong zawthalna ngam pan na suakta uh hi. Tu in Abraham ii Pathian, Isaac ii Pathian, Jacob ii Pathian, Topa zuan kik tavun, tuaciang ama zongh no kung hong zuan kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate ii Pathian, Topa tungah a thumaan ngawl, na taanghpupite le Israel na mipuite bangin om heak vun. Na mu thei bangma in, Topa in nasia takin daan thuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate bangin thinpui ngawlin Topa thu ni vun. Topa note Pathian in no tungah a thin uuk nawn ngawl natu in a tawntungin a thianthosak sa Jerusalem Biakinnpi ah hong pai in ama bia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa na zuan kik uh le na mealheakte, thong a taaksakte in amate khuangai huai sa in inn ah hong ciasak kik tu hi. Topa note Pathian dikin, ngual hesuak thei a, ama na zuan kik uh le ama in hong saang tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kamtaite sia Ephraim le Manasseh namte ii ngamsung khuapi theampo ah pai a, saksang khakbel Zebulun namte teenna dong theng hi, ahihang mite in amate nuisan in selno uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua kawm pan Asher, Manasseh le Zebulun namte sung pan Jerusalem khua ah a pai nuam veve pawlkhat om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah mite sung zongh ah Pathian in naseam a, kumpipa le a uliante thupiakte a thunitna taw ama deina a zui tu in mipite a kibangin thin khensatna neisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tha nii tha in Tol Kisaw Ngawl Anluum Poai vawt tu in mi honpui khat Jerusalem ah kikhawmtua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in Jerusalem khua sungah sangaw biakpiakna le ngimnamtui halna in a kizangh biaknataute theampo la in Kidron kuam ah vawk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang tua tha a ni sawm le ni li ni in amate in Paisan Poai sangaw biakpiakna atu tuute ngo uh hi. A zeksa om bangin a thiang ngawl lai thiampite le Levi te sia a maizum mama in Topa mai ah amate le amate ki aaptuam hi; tuasia ciang tu in amate in Biakinnpi sungah meihal biakpiakna pia thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian mi Moses ii Thukham sungah a thupiak bangin amate in Biakinnpi sungah omna mun la tek hi. Levi te in sangaw biakpiaknate ii a chite thiampite pia a, thiampite in biaknatau tungah the uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipite tam mama sia a zeksa om bangin thiang ngawl ahi hu in Paisan Poai tuute ngo thei ngawl ahikom amate taangin Levi te in ngoin Topa tungah tuuno te aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaban ah, Ephraim, Manasseh, Issachar le Zebulun namte sung panin hong pai mihing tam mama te in a zeksa thiansuana vawt ngawl ahikom amate in Paisan Poai sia a ngeina zui ngawlin tang uh hi. Hezekiah kumpipa in amate atu in hi bangin thungetsak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ka taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa awng, a zeksa om bangin thiang ngawl ahitazong a thinsung theampo taw nang hong bia amate tungah na thin phatna taw maisak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in Hezekiah thungetna saang a; tua mite mawna maisak in, ngim ngasak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerusalem khua ah a kikhawmtua mite theampo in Tol Kisaw Ngawl Anluum Poai sia lungdamna lianpi taw ni sali sung vawt hi; ni khat zawkciang ni khat thiampite le Levi te in a tha neiza taw Topa pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hezekiah in Topa biakna vawt a thiam Levi te pok hi. A taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa a pokna in ni sali sung sangaw biakpiaknate a nei zawkciang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />amate teng in a dang ni sali sung ma poai vawt natu in khensat hi. Tuabangin amate lungdam takin poai vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hezekiah kumpipa in tua poai ah mipite neak tu in khuital 1,000 le tuu 7,000 pia in a uliante in a dang khuital 1,000 le tuu 10,000 pia uh hi. Thiampi tam mama in a zeksa kithiansuana vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahikom mite theampo — Judah mi, thiampite, Levi te, saksang ngam pan hong pai mite le Israel le Judah ngam sungah a teang suak ngamdangmite, a kuama po lungdam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jerusalem khuapi sia lungdamna taw kidim hi, banghang ziam cile tuabang lungdamnate David ii tapa Solomon kumpipa hunlai pan kipan om ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thiampite le Levi te in mipite atu in Topa tungah thupha ngetsak hi. Vantung a inn pan Pathian in amate thungetna za in saang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua poai a man zawkciang Israel mite theampo Judah khuapi teng ah pai a, suangkhuamte sutan in Asherah numeipathian ii limte phuktan in biaknatau te le doai sepna munte sutham hi. Amate in a taanglai Judah ngam theampo, tuaciang Ephraim, Benjamin le Manasseh ngamte ah tuabang ma in vawt hi; tua zawkciang amate inn zuan kik siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezekiah kumpipa in thiampite le Levi te ii nasep kipawlna puuapha kik a, tuabangin mi simin vaipuak nei tek hi. Tuate in meihal biakpiaknate, kipawlkhop biakpiaknate, biakinn biakpiakna sungah kihelna, Biakinnpi sung mun tuatuam ah Pathian min pokna le Pathian tungah lungdamkonate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zing le nitak veu in a kiseam meihal biakpiaknate le Sabbath ni le Tha Thak Poai atu ahizong, Topa Thukham om bangin vawt a kul Poai dangte atu ahizong Hezekiah in ama ii khuihon le a tuu honte sung pan nganno te pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua banah Topa Pathian Thukham om bangin thiampite le Levi te in a hun nei zaza a piak thei natu in amate nga tu a hi piakkhiatnate a piak tek natu in kumpipa in Jerusalem khua mite thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabangin thu a piak zawk po ciang Israel mite in a antang, sapittui, olive thau, khuaitui te le a dang lo an sung pan a phabel teng letsong in pia hi, tuaciang a neisa theampo sung pan sawm a khat zongh paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah khuapite ah a teang mite theampo in a khui le a tuute sawm a khat puakin, amate ii Pathian, Topa tungah a aapsa letsongte tam mama zongh puak si uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tha thumna tha sungin letsongte hong puak a, tha li sung a kipee in hong thengin kiciangto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hezekiah kumpipa le a uliante in tuabangza a tam letsong a kipiak a mu uh ciang, amate in Topa le Israel a mite pok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi letsongte thu kumpipa in thiampite le Levi te tungah a son ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zadok ii suan Thiampi Lianbel Azariah in Ama tungah, “Mihonpite in a letsongte Biakinnpi ah hong paipui pan kipan, neak tu kicingin tam mama zongh vaal lai hi. Tu bangza theampo ih nei na sia Topa in a mite thupha hong piak hang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa thupiak bangin amate in Biakinnpi suum sungah vanh kholna inndoite vawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua inndoite sungah letsongte le sawm a khat te theampo kikeamcing hi. Amate in tua sia Levi te Conaniah in uksak a, a suapuipa Shimei in husak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate khutnuai ah na seam tu in Levi te sawm kisee a: Jehiel, Azaziah, Nahath, Asahel, Jerimoth, Jozabad, Eliel, Ismachiah, Mahath le Benaiah te ahi hi. Hite theampo sia Hezekiah kumpipa le Thiampi Lianbel Azariah thu taw a kiseam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Biakinnpi Nisuana sang Kongpi a cingpipa Levi mi Imnah ii tapa Kore sia Topa tungah a kipia letsongte a sang tu le tuate a hawmna ah a ukpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thiampite teenna khuapi dangte ah hi Levi dangte in thumaan takin ama nasep a hu te sia: Eden, Miniamin, Jeshua, Shemaiah, Amariah le Shecaniah te ahi hi. Ante sia amate sepna bang zui in Levi mipui te tungah kim hawm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />bee le phung zui in hawm ngawl hi. Amate Biakinnpi ah ni sim vaipuak nei pasal kum 30 ahibuale a tungsia theampo a nasep na mun zui in hawmsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thiampite sia bee le phung zui in nasep kiseesak a, Levi te pasal kum kul le a tungsiate sia a pawl nasepna zui in kisee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate ii a thiangtho nasep thupite bang hun pawpo in sep na tu kingin kul ahikom amate, a zi a tate le a bealh dangte taw a min theampo kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thiampi bangkua sungah a om pa a minpiang le Levi bee le phung min tepteena sungah min om theampote, an a hawmsak tu in vaipuak nei pasal teng sia Aaron suan le paalte atu a kisee khuapite ahibuale hi khuapite ii neisa nganthana munte sungah a teang thiampite sung pan veu a hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judah ngamsung theampo ah Hezekiah kumpipa in a maan sia le Topa a Pathian ii diksak teng seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama ii Biakinnpi a tu a sep theampo ahibuale Thukham zuina thu ah thutakin a thin takpi taw a Pathian a biak hu in a maa tun hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekiah kumpipa in thumaan takin Topa na seam a, hi bang thupiang teng zawkciang Assyria kumpilianpa Sennacherib in Judah ngam sim hi. Ama in kulh taw a ki uum khuapite uumci in a ngalkaphonpite tungah luphungte sulet in a kaantan natu thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sennacherib in Jerusalem khuapi zongh sim a sawm hunlam Hezekiah in a phaw ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assyria te Jerusalem khua hong nai ciang tui a nga ngawl natu in ama le a uliante in khuapi pua sang pan tuinaakte khakcip tu in khensat uh hi. Uliante lampui in khua mite tam mama kuan tek a, tui a suak nawn ngawl natu in tuinaak theampo khakcip uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa in khuapi uumna luphungte puuapha in, a tungah ngal vilna tausaangte sa in khuapi uumna pua sangah luphung cian thuana taw ngal nannate khosak hi. Tuaban ah, ama in Jerusalem khua lui mun khen khat ii nisuana sang lei kidipna tungah ngalnanna a sakte zongh puua kik hi. Ama in lum le tei tam mama zongh vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in khuapi sung pasal om theampo ngalkap bute khutnuai ah koi in khuapi kongpi leitual ah a kikhoptua natu thupia hi. Ama in amate tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Citakin kimuang vun, Assyria kumpilianpa ahibuale a lampui ngalkaphonpi sia kiita heak vun. Ama sangah a nei thahatna sangin ei sangah a om thahatna nasia zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in mihing thahatna nei ahihang eite in hong hu tu le ih ngalte hong simsak tu in Topa ih Pathian kinei hi,” ci hi. A kumpipa ii hi kammalte in mite hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tawmvei zawkciang Sennacherib le a ngalkaphonpite Lachish ah a om hun laitakin, Sennacherib in Jerusalem khua ah a om Hezekiah kumpipa le ama taw a omkhawm Judah mite tungah hi thu teng puak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Keima Assyria kumpilianpa Sennacherib in kong dok nopna pan, a ki uumci Jerusalem khua sungah na om ngam lai natu sia bang in kimuanna hong pia ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ko khut sung panin Topa na Pathian in no hong hun tu hi ci in Hezekiah in hong son hi, ahihang Hezekiah in note hong theam a, ngilkial dangtaak in hong thisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa biakna munte le biaknataute a sutham sia ama hi a, Judah le Jerusalem mite tungah biaknatau khat bek ah biakna vawt in ngimnamtui a halsak sia zongh ama ma hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngamdangmite tungah ka taanghpupite le keima ngamtatna he ngawl nu ziam? Ngamdang khat pawpo ii pathiante in a mite Assyria kumpilianpa khut sung panin a hun ngei ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bang hunin tua ngam teng ii pathiante khat pawpo in a ngam sia ko khut sung pan hun ngei na ziam? Tua ahile na pathian in nang hong hun thei hi ci sia, bang in hong ngaisunsak ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu in Hezekiah in tuabangin theamsak heak vun a, tuabangin lamkhial puisak heak vun. Ama um heak vun! Ngam khat pawpo ii pathian in a mite sia Assyria kumpilianpa khat pawpo khut sung pan hun zo ngeingawl hi. Tua ahiciang hi note pathian in note hong hun takpi zo ngawl tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Assyria uliante in Topa Pathian le Topa naseampa Hezekiah te siat son zaw lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpilianpa in Israel te ii Pathian Topa a dona lai thaak a tuasung ah, “Tua ngamte ii pathiante in keima khut sung panin a mite hun ngawl hi, Hezekiah ii pathian in ka khut sung pan a mite hun ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua uliante in tua khuapi a ol zaw in a laak thei natu in luphung tungah a om Jerusalem mite a lau natu le a thinkiam natu in Hebrew kam taw, a tung a teng ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in mihing khut taw a kivawt tawm milimte, midangte ii pathiante a sonna taw ma kibangin Jerusalem Pathian zongh sonsak lel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Hezekiah kumpipa le Amoz ii tapa, kamsaang Isaiah te in Pathian tungah thungen a, au in huna ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in vantunglalang khat paisakin Assyria ngalkap te le a ngalkapbute thatsak hi. Tua ahikom a kumpilianpa sia maimawlin Assyria ngam ah heak kik hi. Ni khat ni in ama sia a pathian biakinn sungah a om laitakin a tapate pawlkhat in a namsau uh taw ama thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuabangin Topa in Hezekiah kumpipa le Jerusalem mi teng Assyria kumpilianpa Sennacherib le a ngal dangte khut sung pan zongh suatak hi. Ama in a mite sia a kiim le a paam ngam theampo taw kilemin teangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihing tam mama in Topa tungah a piak tu biakpiakna te le Hezekiah tungah a piak tu letsongte kengin Jerusalem ah hong pai uh hi, tuabangin tua hun pan kipan minam theampo mai ah Hezekiah sia kizakta in kithasia mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua hun khawngin Kumpipa Hezekiah a ciina in thi dek tak hi. Ama in thungen a, Topa in a dam natu lim khat lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang Hezekiah kiphasak leih in Topa ii ama atu a vawtsak nate hangin lungdamko ngawl hi, tuaciang Judah le Jerusalem mite in ngim nga law uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahizong a khakbel ciang Hezekiah le Jerusalem mite kiniamkhiak kik ahikom Topa in Hezekiah ii thi dong tua mite daan pia ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hezekiah kumpipa hau mama a, kuama po in vaang pia hi. Ama in a neisa ngunn, khamh, suangmanpha te, hel namtuite, lumte le vanh manpha dangte khol natu in vanh kholna inndoite sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaban ah ante, sapittui le olive thau kholna tu inndoite; a khuite atu in khuibukte; tuaciang a tuute atu tuu khawk te sasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaban ah Pathian in tuu le khui te pia in a dang nei le lamh tam mama pia ahikom ama in khuapi tam ma saat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gihon Ciktui ii pusuana vang khaktan in Jerusalem luphung sungsang mun khat dongin leinuai ah tui kheetna luam a vawt sia Hezekiah kumpipa ahi hi. A sep a vawt theampo Hezekiah in taangtun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a ngam sungah a lamdang a piang thu kan tu in Babylon tongciinte a pai laitak ngawngawnin a ngamtatna a heak ku nopna in Pathian in Hezekiah sia ama uuk thu in ngamtasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hezekiah kumpipa ii a nasep dang teng le Topa tungah a kipiaknate theampo sia Amoz Tapa Kamsaang Isaiah ii Mukholna sung le Judah le Israel Kumpipate ii Taanghthu sungah kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hezekiah thi a, kumpite thaan tungnung ah kiphum hi. A thi ciang, Judah le Jerusalem mite theampo in zatakna lianpi pia uh hi. A tapa Manasseh in a kumpiza laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh sia kum sawm le kum nii a phak ciangin Judah kumpi suak a, ama in Jerusalem pan kum 55 sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite maisang a manaw lai in tua ngamsung pan Topa ii a nawkeak minamte ii a kiihuai ngamtatna te zui in Manasseh sia Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a pa Hezekiah ii suksiat sa doai biakna munte sa kik hi. Ama in Baal biakna tu in biaknataute sa a, Asherah numeipathian limte vawtin aksite bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa ii ama a tawntungin a kibiak natu mun a cina Biakinnpi sungah ama in doai biaknataute vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Biakinnpi leitual nii te ah aksite biakna tu in biaknataute vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a tapate Hinnom Kuam ah meihal biakpiakna in nei hi. Ama in mitbum le aisaanna zangh a, maisang thu a sontheite le thaa sam theite thu dongh hi. Ama in Topa tungah maw mama in a thin uuksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Topa Biakinnpi sungah milim khat koi a, tua mun in Pathian ii David le a tapa Solomon tungah, “Hi lai Jerusalem khua sung, hi Biakinnpi sung sia keima hong kibiak natu in, Israel minam sawm le niite ii ngamsung theampo panin ka tealna mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mite in ka thukham theampo zui in ka naseampa Moses ii amate a piak Thukham buppi a zui uh le a taanghpupite tungah ka piak ngam panin a kinawkeak tu ka oai buatu hi,” a ci sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa mihing Israel mite maisang a manaw lai in, tua ngamsung pan Topa ii nawkeak minamte ii mawna sang zong a lianzaw te ngawngawn a vawt tu in Manasseh in Judah mite lampui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Manasseh le a mite a kidop natu in son hi napi amate in nangai ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa in Assyria ngalkapmangte in Judah ngam simsak hi. Amate in Manasseh manin thikkawn le kol bulin Babylon ah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi bangin a thuakna hu in ama kiniamkhiak in Topa a Pathian zuanin huna ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Manasseh ii thungetna sia Pathian in saang a, Jerusalem ah heak kiksakin a ngam uksak kik hi. Hisia in Topa ma Pathian a hina thu Manasseh in telsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciang Manasseh in David Khuapi nisuana sangah a om luphung puanung sia Gihon Cik hui Kuam sung panin saksang ah Ngasa Kongpi le Ophel kici khuapi huam ciang dong saangsak vaial hi. Judah ngam sungah kulh taw a ki uum khuapi sim ah ngalkap honkhat le a uk ngalkapbu khat veu koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in Biakinnpi sung panin ngamdang pathiante le tua munah ama koi milim sia ahizong, Biakinnpi omna mualtung le Jerusalem khua sung mun dangte ah a om doai sepna biaknataute ahizong khiin hi; ama in hite theampo Jerusalem khua pua sangah paipui in vawk siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in Topa a kibiakna biaknatau zongh puua kikin tua tungah kipawlkhop biakpiaknate le lungdamko biakpiaknate pia hi. Ama in Israel te ii Pathian, Topa a biak natu in Judah mite theampo thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mite in biakna mun dangte ah sangaw biakpiaknate pia suak ahitazong amate in Topa tung bekma ah pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Manasseh ii a nasep dangte theampo a Pathian tungah a thungetna le Topa Israel ii Pathian min taw kamsaangte ii ama tungah a thupuakte theampo Israel Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa ii thungetna le Pathian zo kikna, a kisiik kik ma in a vawt mawna khialna — a sia a vawtte, doai sepna munte le numeipathian Asherah lim, tuaciang a biak milimte — theampo sia Kamsaangte Taanghthu sungah kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Manasseh thi a, kumpi inn ah kiphumin, a tapa Amon in a kumpiza laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amon in Judah kumpi a sua lai in kum 22 pha a, Jerusalem panin kum nii sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pa Manasseh bangma in ama in Topa tungah maw in a pa ii biak milimte bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang ama ahile a pa bang hi ngawl a, kiniamkhiak ngawlin Topa kung zuan ngawl hi; a pa sang zong mawzaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amon sia a uliante ma in thasawm a, kumpi inn sungah thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amon a suamte sia Judah mite in thatin, a tapa Josiah kumpi suaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah in kum liat a phak ciang Judah kumpi suak a, Jerusalem panin kum 31 sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Topa diksak nate vawt a; a taanghpupi David ngamtatna zui in Pathian ii thukham theampo pha takin zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josiah a kumpi sua zawk kum liat a phak kumin khangmoi mama lai ahihang ama in a taanghpupi David kumpipa ii Pathian a biak kipan hi. Kum li zawkciang ama in doai sepna munte, Asherah numeipathian limte le a dang milimte theampo a suksiat kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama ii thupiak bangin a mite in Baal biakna biaknataute sutham in a kungah ngimnamtui halna biaknataute pheltham hi. Amate in Asherah milimte le a dang milimte theampo suuvui in, a vui teng sia tua milimte sangaw biakpiakna a pia mite ii thaan tungah the uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in doai seam thiampite ii ngu teng amate ii biaknataute tungah hal hi. Hi bang teng taw Josiah in Judah le Jerusalem sia a zeksa ngeina om bangin thiansua kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in khuapite sung le Manasseh ngam, Ephraim ngam le Simeon ngamsung a zawna mun theampo, tuaciang saksang ah Naphtali dongin tuabang ma in vawt siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saksang kumpi ngam theampo ah ama in biaknataute le Asherah limte sutham in milimte suuvui a, ngimnamtui halna biaknataute theampo sem tham hi. Tua zawkciang ama Jerusalem ah heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josiah kumpipa in a kumpi maan zawk kum sawm le kum liat kumin, a ngam le Biakinnpi sia doai biakna a bosakna taw a thiansua zawkciang ama in Topa Pathian Biakinnpi puua kik tu in pasal thum paisak a: Azaliah tapa Shaphan, Jerusalem a uk mangpa Maaseiah le ulian khat ahi Joahaz ii tapa Joah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levi biakinn cingte ii Biakinnpi sung pan a khon sum teng Thiampi Lianbel Hilkiah tungah ki aap hi. (Tua sumte sia Ephraim mi, Manasseh mi le a taanglai Saksang kumpingam mite, Judah mi, Benjamin mi, Jerusalem mite tung pan a kikhonte hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua sum teng biakinn puua kikna a ukte thum tungah ki aap a, amate in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah kumpite ii a muatsak innte puua natu a kizangh suang le thing lei natu in lettamate le inn sate a piak tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua na a seamte thumaan tatak hi. Amate sia Levi mite li ahi Merari bee le phung pan Jahath le Obadiah, Kohath bee le phung pan Zechariah le Meshullam te in uk uh hi. (Tua Levi te sia a vekpi in music thiam uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A dang Levi te in vanh nawn na le nasep dang tuatuam a seamte uk in, a dangte sia thu tepteena a keamte ahibuale a cingte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vanh kholna inndoi sung pan sum a laak laitakin Hilkiah in Moses tungah Pathian piak Thukham, Topa Thukham laibu sia mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in Shaphan munah, “Hi Biakinnpi sungah Thukham laibu mu khi hi,” ci hi. Ama in tua laibu Shaphan pia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Shaphan in kumpipa kungah paipui hi. Ama in, “Nong sawl theampo ka seam siat zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Biakinnpi sungah a kep sum teng ka la zo uh hi, tuasia naseamte le a ukte tungah ka pia zo uh hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in, “Hi sungah Hilkiah ii hong piak laibu khat om hi,” ci lai hi. Tuaciang ama in tuasia kumpipa tungah nging vazak in sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa in laibu a kisim na bang a zaak ciang, thin nop ngawlna taw a puansilh lai eaukeak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuaciang Hilkiah, Shaphan tapa Ahikam, Micaiah tapa Abdon, zum thuzeakpipa Shaphan le kumpipa cing pa Asaiah te tungah hi bang thupia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Pai tavun a, kei taang le Israel le Judah ah a om lai mite taangin Topa ii thu dongh tavun. Hi laibu ii hilnate hong kan tavun. Ei tungah Topa thin uuk hi, banghang ziam cile ih taanghpupite in Topa kammal zui ngawl a, hi laibu ii sep hamtang tu a cite seam ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa thupiak bangin Jerusalem ii a khen khuathak mun khat sungah a teang Huldah a kici numei kamsaang khat munah thu dongh tu in, Hilkiah, Ahikam, Achbor, Shaphan le Asaiah te pai uh hi. (Tua nu ii pasal sia, Tikvah ii tapa, Harhas ii tupa Shallum hi a, ama in biakinn puantualte a keam pa hi.) Amate in thupiang teng ama munah son uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuaciang ama in kumpipa kungah amate pai kikin sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A nuai a Topa thupiak teng puak hi: “Keima in Jerusalem le a mite theampo kumpipa tungah a kisim laibu sia sungah a ki at haamsiatna te taw daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in kei hong nial a, pathian dangte tungah sangaw biakpiaknate pia ahikom a ngamtatna theampo panin ka thin uukna piang hi. Ka thin uukna sia Jerusalem tungah tu hi, tuaciang tua sia veng ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpipa mama atu in hi bangin kei, Israel ii Topa Pathian in ci khi hi: Nangma in laibu sungah a ki at teng nadon ni hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tuaciang Jerusalem le a mite daan piak tu ka tawnna na zaak ciang kiniamkhiakna le kisii kikna taw ka mai ah na puansilh eaukeak in kap ni hi. Na thungetna hong za zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaciang Jerusalem ka piak tu daan sia na thi zawk ciang mateng in tungsak ngawl tu khi hi. Thinnuam in kong thisak tu hi,” ci hi. Tua pasalte hi thupiak teng taw Josiah kumpipa kungah heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa Josiah in Judah le Jerusalem lampui teng sam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tuaciang amate a pai uh ciangin, thiampite le Levi te in tonpui in, a taanglai mi theampo taw a hau a zawng kibangin Biakinnpi ah paikhawm tek hi. Kumpipa in amate ii mai ah Biakinnpi sungah a kimu thuciamna laibu bup a ngingin sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in kumpi khuam sia kungah dingin Topa thu a ni tu, a thukham te le a thupiakte sia a thin theampo le a ngaisutna theampo taw a keamcing tu, tuaciang thuciamna taw a kithua tua laibu sungah hong tangkal theampo a seam a vawt tu in ama taw thuciamna khat vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in tua thuciamna a zui kik natu in Benjamin mite le Jerusalem ah a om dang teng theampo kiciamsak hi. Tuabangin Jerusalem mite in a taanghpupite ii Pathian taw a vawt sa thuciamna ii dei nate zui tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Josiah kumpipa in Israel te neisa a ngam sungah a om a kiihuai milim theampo susia hi, tuaciang ama nuntak lai teng mipite in amate taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa na seamsak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah kumpipa in Topa patoaina in Jerusalem khua ah Paisan Poai vawt hi; a tha masabel, ni sawm le ni li ni in tua poai atu in ngannote kingo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in thiampite ii Biakinnpi sungah a nasep tu seesakin amate nasep tek a phatak a sep natu in hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Topa tungah a ki aap Israel syate ahi Levi te tungah hi thute hil hi: “David tapa Solomon kumpipa ii a sak Biakinnpi sungah tua Thuciamna Thingkuang thiangtho koi vun. Tua sia mun khat pan mun khat ah khiin kawkoai nawn heak vun, Topa na Pathian le Israel a mite ii na seam tunu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David kumpipa le a tapa Solomon ii nasep hong seesak bangin Biakinnpi sungah bee le phung zui in panmun la tek vun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Noma pawlkhat in Israel mi sungah bangkua khat sim hu a kul ciang, na hu paih thei natu noma ma vaihawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Noma in Paisan Poai atu in tuunote le kealte ngo tu nu hi. Tu in Topa ii Moses tungah a piak thuhilnate Israel na mipuite ii a zui thei natu in noma le noma a zeksa om bangin kithiangsak vun a, sangaw biakpiaknate pia tu in kinging vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josiah kumpipa in Paisan Poai hun sung mipite zak tu in ama ii khoai nganhonte sung pan tuute, tuunote le kealnote a vekpi 30,000 le khuital 3,000 pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A uliante zongh in mipite, thiampite le Levi te zak tu in pia tek hi. Biakinnpi uk uliante — Thiampi Lianbel Hilkiah, Zechariah le Jehiel — in tua poai sungah sangaw biakpiaknate a tu in thiampite tungah tuuno le kealno 2,600 le khuital 300 pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levi lampuite — Conaniah, Shemaiah le a suapuipa Nethanel, Hashabiah, Jeiel le Jozabad — in tuuno le kealno 5,000 le khuital 500 sia Levi te ii sangaw biakpiaknate a tu in pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Paisan Poai atu in na theampo a vaihawm siat zawkciang kumpipa ii thupiak bangin thiampite le Levi te in amate nasepna mun tek ah om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuu le keal a kingaw zawkciang Levi te in a vun hoai in thiampite in biaknatau tungah a chi the uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses Thukham sungah hilna om bangin a piak thei tu in meihal biakpiaknate a tu ngannote sia amate in a innkuan pawl tuatuamte zui in mipite hawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Levi te in ngeina om bangin Paisan Poai sangawte sia mei tungah em in a thiangtho biakpiakna sate sia bealte, bealpeu a lian a no te sungah huanin mipite tungah manlang takin hawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiteng a vawt zawkciang Levi te in amate atu le Aaron suan thiampite atu in sa hawm uh hi, banghang ziam cile ngannote pum bup halna le sangaw biakpiaknate pan a sathaute a halna in thiampite zan dongin komla uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asaph bee le phung pan a nuai a Levi music thiamte sia David kumpipa thupiakna bangin nasep kiseena munte ah om tek hi: Asaph, Heman le kumpipa ii kamsaang Jeduthun ahi uh hi. Biakinn kongpi cingte in a cinna mun tek nusiat kul ngawl hi; banghang ziam cile amate atu in Levi dangte in Paisan Poai kingingsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom Josiah kumpipa thupiak bangin Topa biakna Paisan Poai vawtna a tu le biaknatau tungah meihal biakpiaknate a tu teng tua ni in a vekpi kivawt siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua munah a om Israel mite a vekpi in Paisan Poai le Tol Kisaw ngawl Anluum Poai ni sali sung vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kamsaangpa Samuel hun lai pan kipan Paisan Poai hi bangin kivawt ngeingawl hi. Paisan Poai sia Josiah kumpipa, thiampite, Levi te le Judah, Israel le Jerusalem mite ii
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Josiah kumpi maan zawk kum sawm le kum liat kum in, a vawt bangin tua masia kumpite kuama in vawt ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Josiah kumpipa in Biakinnpi atu in hite theampo a vawt zawkciang Egypt kumpipa Neco in Euphrates ngun tungah a om Carchemish ah ngalsim tu in a ngalkaphonpi paipui hi. Josiah in ama tawlngaksak tu in hanciam hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ahizong Neco in Josiah tungah hi bangin thupuak hi: “Judah kumpipa awng, ka ngalsim tu sia nang taw kisai ngawl hi. Nang hong sim tu in hong pai hi ngawl a, ka ngalte a sim tu in a kuan ka hi hi. Pathian in manlangin hong sawl hi. Pathian in keima sangah pang ahikom kei hong nalh heak in, tua ahibuale ama in nang hong susia tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang Josiah in sim sawm veve hi. Ama in Pathian ii Neco kumpipa tungtawnin a thusonte na ngai ngawlin kimealseal in Megiddo zaangtam ah ngalsim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngal kisim sungin Egypt te ii thaltangte in Josiah kumpipa kha hi. Ama in a naseamte tungah, “Hong taipui tavun; nasia liam khi hi!” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in a siphu ngalleang tung panin toai in tua munah a om ama siphu ngalleang niina sia tungah suanh in Jerusalem ah paipui uh hi. Tua munah ama thi in kumpite thaan ah kiphum hi. Judah le Jerusalem mite theampo ama thi hu in khuangai tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kamsaangpa Jeremiah in Josiah kumpipa atu in khuangai la khat phuak hi. Ama atu khuangai in a kaa uh ciang la sate in nupite ahizong pasalte ahizong hi khuangai la a zak uh sia Israel te ngeina suak hi. Tua late sia khuangai late khoptuana sungah kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josiah ii a sep theampo — Topa tungah a kipiakna, Thukham a zuina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />le ama taanghthu a kipatna pan a tawpna dong — Israel le Judah Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kiciamtee siat hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah mite in Josiah ii tapa Joahaz teal a Jerusalem khua ah ama sathau noai in kumpi suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah kumpi a sua lai in Joahaz kum 23 pha a, Jerusalem pan tha thum sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa Neco in ama thongtaaksak a, Judah panin Neco tungah ngunn kilogramme 3,400 le khamh kilogramme 34 phiangshia in piasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Neco in Joahaz ii suapuipa Eliakim Judah kumpi suaksak a, a min Jehoiakim ci in laihsak hi. Joahaz sia Neco in Egypt ngam ah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoiakim sia Judah kumpi a sua lai in kum 25 pha a, Jerusalem pan kum sawm le kum khat sung uk hi. Ama in Topa a Pathian tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Judah ngam sim in, Jehoiakim man a thikkol bulin Babylon ah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in Biakinnpi vanh manpha pawlkhat pua in Babylon a kumpi inn ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiakim ii a sep a vawt theampo, a kiihuai ngamtatnate le a tatsiatnate dongin Israel le Judah kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kiciamtee hi. A tapa Jehoiachin in a kumpiza laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoiachin sia Judah kumpi a sua lai in kum sawm le kum liat pha a, ama in Jerusalem pan tha thum le ni sawm sung uk hi. Ama zongh Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuakhaal kipat ciang Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa in Jehoiachin sia thongtaak tu in Babylon ah paipui hi. Biakinnpi sum le vanh manphate zongh pua hi. Tua zawkciang Nebuchadnezzar in Jehoiachin ii pano Zedekiah sia Judah le Jerusalem kumpi suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zedekiah sia Judah kumpi a sua lai in kum 21 pha a, ama in Jerusalem pan kum sawm le kum khat sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in Topa tungah maw in Topa kammal a son kamsaangpa Jeremiah ii thusonte kiniamkhiakna taw ngai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa ii ama tungah a thumaan tu in Pathian min taw hamtangpi in a kiciamsak Zedekiah in ama leedo hi. Zedekiah thinpui in kisiik kik nuam ngawlin Israel te ii Pathian, Topa kung zuan kik nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua banah Judah lampuite, thiampite le mipite in a kiim ah a om minamte ii mawna khialnate zui in milim bia uh hi, tuabangin amate in Topa mama ii a thiansak Biakinnpi ninsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa in amate le a Biakinnpi a huuk nop manin a mite kidop thei natu in kamsaangte tatsat ngawlin paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahizong amate in Pathian ii kamtaite nunau in, a kammalte awlmawk ngawl a, kamsaangte nuisan uh hi, a khakbel ciang a mite tungah Topa thin uukna nasia tatak ahikom suatak natu lampi om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa in amate sim tu in Babylon kumpipa paisak hi. Kumpipa in Judah tangvalte Biakinnpi sung ngawngawn ah thatlum hi. Kumpipa in a moi a haam, numei pasal, a ciina a ciidam ci doi ngawlin kuama hesuak ngawl hi. Pathian in amate a vekpi ma ama tungah aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in Biakinnpi sung, biakinn sum le vanh manpha, kumpipa le a uliante nei le lam teng theampo laksak a Babylon ah pua kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in Biakinnpi le khuapi sia a kumpi innte le a nei a lam theampo taw haltum in khuapi uumna luphungte sutham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in a nungta lai theampo Babylon ah ciapui a, tua munah amate in sila bangin Persia kumpilianpa hong khan dong ama le a suan a paalte ii na seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabangin kamsaang Jeremiah tungtawn a, Topa ii hi bang a sonkhol sa sia taangtung hi: “Sabbath tawlngakna a kitang ngawl teng lo kik natu in a ngam sia kum sawmsali sung ngamtongta hi tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Persia mi Cyrus, kumpilianpa a sep, a kum khat na kumin Topa in kamsaang Jeremiah tungtawn a, a thusonte taangtungsak hi. A nuai a, a thupiaknate a suasak tu le ama ii ukna ngam theampo ah a nging a sim tu in lai at in a thaak natu Topa in Cyrus thawn hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Hisia in Persia kumpilianpa Cyrus ii thupiakna ahi hi. Vantung Pathian, Topa in leitung buppi uk pa in keima hong koi zo a, Judah ngam Jerusalem ah ama atu biakinn khat sa tu in vaipuak hong pia zo hi. Tu in no, Pathian mite theampo awng, tualai ah va pai tavun a, Topa na Pathian note taw hong omkhawm tahen.”
  </para>
</usx>
